<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Goofa</book>
  <para style="h">Maatoosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Maato</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maatoosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Maatoosi Xaafida Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggelaa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Maatoosi Xaafida</para>
  <para style="mt2">Yesuus Kiristtoosa Wonggelaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofaa</para>
  <para style="ip">Maatoosa Wonggelay, yaana geetettidi ufayssan naagettiya ashsheyssi Yesuusa gideyssanne Xoossay gal77a caaquwan ba asaas immida ufayssa qaalaa poliday iya baggara gideyssa odiya Wonggelaa. Ha Wonggelay Yesuusi entta giddon yelettidi diccida Ayhudeta xalaalas gidonnashin, kumetha alamiya ubbaassa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Maatoosa Wonggelay, daro naagetethan xaafettida maxaafa. Maatoosi ba maxaafaa Yesuusa yeletethan doomidi, iya xammaqetethaanne iya paacetethaa odi simmidi, Galiilan I sabbakidabaa, tamaarssidabaanne hargganchchota pathidabaa odees. Hessafe kaallidi, Yesuusi Galiilappe Yerusalaame bidayssanne I ha sa7an de7ida wode wurssetha saaminttan hanidabata qonccisees. Hessika iya kaqetethaa, iya hayquwanne iya dendduwa oykkees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha Wonggelay, Yesuusi Xoossaa higgiya birshshanaw maati de7eyssanne Xoossaa kawotethaabaa tamaarssiya gita asttamaare oothidi shiishees. Iya timirttiyafe dariya baggay dumma dumma maaran giigettida ichchashu kifiletan shaakettees.</para>
  <para style="ip">1@ Xoossaa kawotethan de7iya asaa hanotethaa, oosuwa, maatanne wurssetha qaadaa odiya Deriya Bolla Timirttiya (Shem 5-7).</para>
  <para style="ip">2@ Tammanne nam77u tamaareti Wonggelaa sabbakanaw bida wode enttaw imettida kaalesuwa (Shem 10).</para>
  <para style="ip">3@ Xoossaa kawotethabaa tamaarssanaw shiiqida dumma dumma leemisota (Shem 13).</para>
  <para style="ip">4@ Iya tamaare gidobaa birshshethaa odiya timirttiya (Shem 18).</para>
  <para style="ip">5@ Ha77i alamiya wurssethaanne Xoossaa kawotethaa yuussabaa odiya timirttiya (Shem 24-25).</para>
  <para style="iot">Maatoosa Wonggelaa ayfe qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuus Kiristtoosa yeletethaa susaanne iya yeletethaa 1:1-2:23</para>
  <para style="io1">Xammaqiya Yohaannisa oosuwa 3:1-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusa xinqqatiyanne paacetethaa 3:13-4:11</para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusi Galiilan ba oosuwa oykkidayssa 4:12-18:35</para>
  <para style="io1">Galiilappe Yerusalaame gakkanaw 19:1-20:34</para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssetha saamintta Yerusalaame heeran 21:1-27:66</para>
  <para style="io1">Godaa hayqoppe dendduwanne qonccethaa 28:1-20</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa yeletethaa susaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luuqa 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hayssafe kaallidi xaafettidayssi Dawite na7a Abrahaame na7a gidida Yesuus Kiristtoosa yeletethaa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Abrahamey Yisaaqa yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Yisaaqi Yayqooba yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Yayqoobi Yihudanne iya ishata yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yihudi Ti7imaarippe Faaresenne Zaara yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Faaresi Esiroome yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Esiroomey Raame yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Raamey Aminaadabe yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Aminaadabey Na7asoone yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Na7asooney Salmoona yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Salmooney Ra7abippe Boo7eze yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Boo7ezi Urutippe Iyobeede yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Iyobeedi Isseyye yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Isseyyey kawuwa Dawite yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Dawitey koyro Ooriyo machcheefe Solomone yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Solomoney Robi7aame yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Robi7aamey Abiya yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Abiyey Asaafe yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Asaafi Iyosaafexe yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Iyosaafixey Iyoraame yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Iyoraamey Ooziyane yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ooziyaney Iyo7atame yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Iyo7atamey Akkaza yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Akkazi Hiziqiyasa yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hiziqiyasi Minaase yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Minaasey Amoona yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Amooni Iyosiyaasa yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Isra7eele asay di7ettidi Babiloone biittaa bida wode Iyosiyaasi Ikoniyananne iya ishata yelis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14-15">2Kawo 24:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2Taari 36:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:20">Er 27:20</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Babiloone biitta Isra7eele asay di7ettidi bidaappe guye Ikoniyaani Selaatiyale yelis.</para>
  <para style="q">Selaatiyaley Zerubaabela yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Zerubaabeli Abdiyu yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Abdiyuy Eliyaaqeme yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Eliyaaqemey Azaara yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Azaari Sadooqe yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Sadooqey Akiime yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Akiimey Eliyuuda yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Eliyuudi Alaazara yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Alaazari Maatane yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Maataney Yayqooba yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yayqoobi Yoosefa yelis;</para>
  <para style="q">Yoosefi Kiristtoosa giya Yesuusa yelida Mayraami azina.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hiza, yeletethay Abrahameppe Dawite gakkanaw tammanne oydda. Dawiteppe bidi Babiloone di7uwa gakkanaw tammanne oydda. Babiloone di7uwappe bidi Kiristtoosa gakkanaw tammanne oyddu yeletethi gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuus Kiristtoosa yeletethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luuqa 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesuus Kiristtoosa yeletethaa taarikey hayssafe kaalleyssa. Iya aaya Mayraama Yoosefas oyshetta de7ashe Yoosefara gahettonna Geeshsha Ayyaanaappe qanthatasu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:27">Luuqa 1:27</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yoosefi Xillo asi gidida gisho iyo asan kessanaw koyibeenna. Yaaniya gisho qosan iyo agganaw qoppis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>I he qofan de7ishin Xoossaa kiitanchchoy amuhon qonccidi, “Dawite na7aw, Yoosefa, Mayraama qanthatiday Geeshsha Ayyaanaappe gidiya gisho iyo ekkanaw yayyofa” yaagis. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iya adde na7a yelana, I ba deriya entta nagaraappe ashshiya gisho iya sunthaa ne Yesuusa gada xeegana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luuqa 1:31</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Goday nabiya Isayaasa doonan, <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Hekko geela7iya qanthatana; adde na7akka yelana; iya sunthay Ammanu7eela geetettana” goyssi polettana mela ha ubbay hanis. Ammanu7eela geyssas birshshethay “Xoossay nuura de7ees” guussu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 7:14">Isa 7:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yoosefi dhiskkofe barkkidi Godaa kiitanchchoy kiittidayssa mela Mayraamo ba soo efis. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin ba bayra na7a yelana gakkanaw iyo bochchibeenna; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">bochchibeenna: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Machchira azinara aqeyssada issife aqibookkona guussu.</char></note> yelettida na7akka Yesuusa gidi xeegis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:21">Luuqa 2:21</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Dolohappe yida asata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Kawuwa Heroodisa woden Yesuusi Yihuda biittan Beeteleme kataman yelettidayssafe guye xoolintto taybiya asati dolohappe Yerusalaame yidi, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Yelettida Ayhude kawoy awun de7ii? Nuuni doloha baggara keyida iya xoolinttuwa be7idi iyaw goynnanaw yida” yaagidi oychchidosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kawoy Heroodisi hessa si7ida wode dagammis. Yerusalaamen de7iya asay ubbayka dagammidosona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Heroodisi kahine halaqatanne higge asttamaareta baakko xeegidi, “Kiristtoosi awun yelettanddeshsha?” yaagidi entta oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Enttika, “Yihuda Beetelemena; nabey,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>‘Yihudan de7iya Beeteleme,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mik 5:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">Yihudan de7iya gooba katamatappe,</para>
  <para style="q2">neeni aybinkka guuxaka.</para>
  <para style="q">Ta deriya Isra7eele aysanayssi,</para>
  <para style="q2">neeppe keyana’ gidi xaafis”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Heroodisi dolohappe yida asata geeman xeegidi, xoolinttuwa entti be7ida wodiya enttafe geeshshidi eris. <verse number="8" style="v"/>I enttana Beeteleme yeddishe, “Bidi yelettida na7aa minthidi koyite; iya hintte demmida wode takka bada iyaw goynnana mela simmidi yishe taw odite” yaagis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Enttika kawoy Heroodisi gidayssa si7idi bidosona. Entti doloha baggara be7ida xoolinttoy enttana kaalethishe na7ay de7iyasuwa gakkanaw efis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Entti he xoolinttuwa be7ida wode gita ufayssi ufayttidosona. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Soo gelidi na7aa ba aaye Mayraamira de7eyssa be7idosona. Iyaw gulbbatidi goynnidosona. Bantta saaxiniya dooyidi worqqa, ixaanenne karbbe iyaw immidosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Entti Heerodisakko guye simmona mela Xoossay amuhon enttaw odin, hara ogera bantta biittaa simmidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Gibxe baqatuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Doloha baggafe yida asati bidaappe guye, Godaa kiitanchchoy Yoosefas amuhon qonccidi, “Heroodisi na7aa wodhanaw koyaa gisho dendda; ellesada na7aanne na7aa aayiw ekkada Gibxe biittaa ba. Ne simmana wodiya ta new odana gakkanaw yan gam77a” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Yoosefi he qamman denddidi, na7aanne na7aa aayiw ekkidi Gibxe bis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nabiya doonan Xoossay, “Taani, ta na7aa, Gibxe biittafe xeegas”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hose 11:1</ref></char></note> geetettida qaalay polettana mela Heroodisi hayqqana gakkanaw I yan de7is.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, doloha baggafe yida asati iya cimmidayssa erida wode daro yilotis. I kase enttafe si7idayssada Beetelemeninne he heeran de7iya nam77u laythi kumidayssatanne nam77u laythafe garssan de7iya adde nayta ubbaa ba wotaddareta yeddidi wodhisis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v"/>Nabiya Ermmiyasa doonan,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Yeehoynne zeleelssi,</para>
  <para style="q2">Raama kataman si7ettis.</para>
  <para style="q1">Raahela ba naytas yeekkawusu;</para>
  <para style="q2">entti hayqqida gisho</para>
  <para style="q1">minettanaw dandda7abuukku”</para>
  <para style="m">gidi odidayssi polettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:15">Er 31:15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Naazirete simuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Heroodisi hayqqidaappe guye Gibxen Godaa kiitanchchoy Yoosefas amuhon qonccidi, <verse number="20" style="v"/>“Na7aa wodhanaw koyaa asati hayqqida gisho, denddada na7aanne na7aa aayiw ekkada Isra7eele biittaa simma” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yoosefi denddidi na7aanne na7aa aayiw ekkidi Isra7eele biittaa simmis. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin Arkkeliyoosi Yihudan ba aawa Heroodisa bessan kawotidayssa si7ida wode yaa baanaw yayyis. Xoossay amuhon iyaw qonccisin Galiila biittaa bis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nabeta doonan, “Naazirete asi geetettana” gidi odettidayssi polettana mela Naazirete katamaa bidi yan de7is.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mar 1:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:39">Luuqa 2:39</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:45">Yoha 1:45</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xammaqiya Yohaannisa timirttiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mar 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-17">Luuqa 3:1-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yoha 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v"/>He wode Xammaqiya Yohaannisi, “Xoossaa kawotethay matattida gisho hintte nagaraappe simmite” yaagidi sabbakishe Yihuda bazzo biittaa yis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1-2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:17">Maato 4:17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:15">Mar 1:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nabiya Isayaasi Yohaannisabaa odidayssa mela,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Bazzo biittan,</para>
  <para style="q2">issoy ba qaala dhoqqu oothidi,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Godaa ogiya giigisite.</para>
  <para style="q1">Iya horogaa piddi oothite’ gis”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Isa 40:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">yaagettiday iyassa yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yohaannisi gimale ikiseppe oosettida afila ma77ees. Ba xeessan dafo danccees. I miya kathayka boolenne degera eesi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2Kawo 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Asay he wode Yerusalaame katamaappe, Yihuda biitta ubbaafenne Yorddaanose Shaafaa heerappe iyaakko yoosona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Bantta nagaraa paaxidi Yorddaanose Shaafan Yohaannisa kushen xammaqettosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yohaannisi, daro Farisaawetinne Saduqaaweti xammaqettanaw baakko yeyssata be7idi, enttako, “Ha iita shooshatoo, yaana Xoossaa hanquwafe baqatana mela hinttena oone zoriday?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Maato 12:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hiza, hinttee, hintte nagaraappe simmidayssa erisiyabaa oothite. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hinttee, hintte wozanan, ‘Abrahamey, nu aaway de7ees’ gidi qoppofite. Loythi si7ite! Xoossay ha shuchchatappe Abrahames na7a kessanaw dandda7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:33">Yoha 8:33</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>Beexey mithaa xaphuwan giigidi uttis; lo77o ayfe ayfonna mitha ubbay qanxettidi taman yegettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:19">Maato 7:19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Hinttee, hintte nagaraappe simmidayssa erisanaw taani hinttena haathan xammaqays. Shin taappe guyera yeyssi hinttena Geeshsha Ayyaananinne taman xammaqana. I taappe daro wolqqaamees; taani hari attoshin iya caammaa tookkanawukka bessike. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kathaa geeshshiya pithey iya kushen de7ees. Kathaa loythi geeshshees; gisttiya ba shaaliyan qolana, shin punuwa to7onna taman xuuggana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa xammaqetethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mar 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luuqa 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>He wode Yesuusi Yohaannisa kushen xammaqettanaw Galiilappe Yorddaanose Shaafaa bis. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin Yohaannisi iya digganaw koyid, “Taani nenan xammaqettanaw koshshishin neeni taakko yay?” yaagis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi zaaridi, “Xoossay nuuppe koyabaa ubbaa nu polanaw bessiya gisho, ha77i taw ero ga” yaagis. Yohaannisi iyaw ero gidi ekkis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesuusi xammaqettida mela haathaafe keyis. Iirakka saloy dooyettin Xoossaa Ayyaanay holleda yishin qassi ba bolla wol77ammidi wodhdhishin be7is. <verse number="17" style="v"/>He wode, “Ta dosiya, iyan tana ufayssiya ta na7ay hayssa” yaagiya qaalay saloppe yis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:18">Maato 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">Luuqa 9:35</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa paacetethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mar 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luuqa 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Xalahey Yesuusa paaccana mela Geeshsha Ayyaanay Yesuusa bazzo biittaa efis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 2:18">Ib 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 4:15">4:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Oytamu qammanne oytamu gallas xoomidaappe guye koshattis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Xalahey Yesuusakko yidi “Neeni Xoossaa na7a gidikko, ane ha shuchchati uythi gidana mela kiitta” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “ ‘Asi Xoossaa doonappe keyaa qaala ubban daanappe attin uytha xalaalan de7enna’ geetettidi Xoossaa qaalan xaafettis”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Zaare 8:3</ref></char></note> yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kaallidikka, Xalahey Yesuusa geeshsha katamaa efidi, Xoossaa keetha huu7iya kessidi, <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Neeni Xoossaa na7a gidikko, ane duge sa7an kundda. Ays giikko,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11">Maz 91:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">‘Ne tohoy shuchchan dhubetti deshettonna mela,</para>
  <para style="q2">bantta kushiyan nena denthana mela,</para>
  <para style="q2">Xoossay ba kiitanchchota ne gisho kiittana’</para>
  <para style="m">geetettidi Xoossaa qaalan xaafettis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesuusi iyaakko, “Qassika, ‘Xoossaa qaalan ne Godaa, ne Xoossaa paaccofa’ yaagettidi xaafettis” gidi zaaris.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Zaare 6:16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wurssethan Xalahey Yesuusa issi wolqqaama deriya huu7e kessidi alamiya kawotethata entta bonchchuwara issife bessidi, <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Ne taw kunddada goynniko ta new ha ubbaa immana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ha Xalahiyaw, taappe haakka! ‘Ne Godaa, ne Xoossaa goynna, iya xalaala haggaaza’ geetettidi Xoossaa qaalan xaafettis” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:13">Zaare 6:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Xalahey aggidi bis; kiitanchchoti yidi iya haggaazidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa timirttiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mar 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luuqa 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesuusi, Yohaannisi qashettoyssa si7ida wode Galiila biittaa bis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Maato 14:3</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:17">Mar 6:17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luuqa 3:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Naazirete katamaa aggidi Zaabiloonaninne Niftaaleme heeran, abbaa matan de7iya Qifirnahoome katamaa bidi yan de7is.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:12">Yoha 2:12</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessi haniday nabiya Isayaasa doonan,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Zaabiloone biittan, Niftaaleme biittan,</para>
  <para style="q2">Yorddaanose Shaafappe hefinthan,</para>
  <para style="q2">abbaa ogiya gaxan de7iya,</para>
  <para style="q2">Ayhude gidonna derey de7iya Galiilan,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15-16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:1-2">Isa 9:1-2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>dhuman de7iya derey,</para>
  <para style="q2">wolqqaama poo7o be7is.</para>
  <para style="q1">Hayqo kuya biittan,</para>
  <para style="q2">de7eyssatas poo7oy keyis”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagidi odettida qaalay polettana melassa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>He wodeppe doomidi Yesuusi, “Xoossaa kawotethay matattida gisho hintte nagaraappe simmite” yaagidi qaala sabbakees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Maato 3:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Koyro tamaareta xeegetethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mar 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luuqa 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesuusi Galiila Abbaa matara aadhdhishe nam77u ishata, Phexiroosa geetettiya Simoonanne iya ishaa Inddiriyasa be7is. Entti molo oykkeyssata gidida gisho bantta gitiya abban yeggoosona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttana, “Haa yiite; tana kaallite! Molo oythi attoshin, ta hinttena ase oythi tamaarssana” yaagis. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Enttika, ellesidi bantta gitiya yeggi aggidi Yesuusa kaallidosona.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 1 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesuusi yaappe buroo gede sinthe aadhdhishe hara nam77u ishata, Zabdiyoosa nayta, Yayqoobanne Yohaannisa be7is. Bantta aawa Zabdiyoosara issife wogoluwa giddon bantta gitiya giigiseyssata xeegis. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Enttika, ellesidi bantta wogoluwanne bantta aawa aggidi Yesuusa kaallidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi hargganchchota pathis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luuqa 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi Ayhude Woosa Keethatan tamaarssishe, salo kawotethaa Wonggelaa odishenne dumma dumma harggiyafe asaa pathishe Galiila biitta ubban yuuyis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:35">Maato 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mar 1:39</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessafe denddoyssan iya sunthay Sooriya biitta ubban keyis. Dumma dumma harggen oykettidayssatanne waayetteyssata, tuna ayyaanan oykettidayssata, shoci yeggiya harggen oykettidayssatanne, gunddata iyaakko ehidosona; ikka enttana pathis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Asay Galiilappe, Tammu Katamatappe, Yerusalaameppe, Yihudappenne Yorddaanose Shaafaa hefinthan de7iya biittaafe yida daro asay iya kaallidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi deriya bolla tamaarssida timirttiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Daro derey shiiqidayssa Yesuusi be7ida wode deriya bolla keyidi uttis. Iya tamaareti iyaakko shiiqin, <verse number="2" style="v"/>hayssada yaagidi tamaarssis:</para>
  <para style="s">Tuma ufayssaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:2-23">Luuqa 6:2-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Bantta ayyaanan manqoti anjjettidayssata,</para>
  <para style="q2">salo kawotethay enttassa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yeekkeyssati anjjettidayssata,</para>
  <para style="q2">entti minthetho demmana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:2">Isa 61:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Bantta wozanan ashkketi anjjettidayssata,</para>
  <para style="q2">entti sa7aa laattana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:11">Maz 37:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Xillobaa oothanaw koshatteyssatinne saamotteyssati anjjettidayssata,</para>
  <para style="q2">entti kallana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 55:1">Isa 55:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Maareyssati anjjettidayssata,</para>
  <para style="q2">entti maarotethi demmana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Wozana geeshshati anjjettidayssata,</para>
  <para style="q2">entti Xoossaa be7ana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 24:3">Maz 24:3</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Sigetheyssati anjjettidayssata,</para>
  <para style="q2">entti Xoossaa nayta geetetti xeegettana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Xillobaa oothiya gisho gidi,</para>
  <para style="q2">goodetteyssati anjjettidayssata,</para>
  <para style="q2">salo kawotethay enttassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:14">1Phexi 3:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Asay hinttena ta gisho gidi cayaa wode, gooddiya wodenne hintte bolla iitabaa ubbaa worddon odisiya wode hintte anjjettidayssata.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 4:14">1Phexi 4:14</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hintte woytoy salon gita gidiya gisho ufayttite, hashshu giite. Hinttefe kase de7iya nabeta hessada goodidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2Taari 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:52">Ha@O 7:52</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Maxinenne poo7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Hinttee biittaas maxine; maxiney ba maxinetethaa aggiko, ba mal7otethaa waati zaari demmanee? Kare holin asan yedhdhettanaappe attin aybiskka maaddenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:50">Mar 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luuqa 14:34-35</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Hintte biittaas poo7o; dere bolla de7iya katamiya qosettanaw dandda7ukku.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:12">Yoha 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:5">9:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Xomppe oythidi son de7iya asa ubbaas poo7ana mela dhoqqa son wotheesippe attin daallo gidon wothey baawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mar 4:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:16">Luuqa 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">11:33</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessa mela asay hintte lo77o oosuwa be7idi, salon de7iya hintte aawa bonchchana mela hintte poo7oy asa sinthan poo7o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:12">1Phexi 2:12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Muse higgiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Taani Muse higgiyanne nabeta qaala shaaranaw yida hinttew daanoppo. Taani, entti odidayssi tuma gideyssa qonccisanaw yasippe attin shaaranaw yabiikke. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta hinttew tuma odays; saloynne sa7ay aadhdhana gakkanaw higge ubbay polettanaappe attin higgiyafe issi qaalay woykko pidaaley aadhdhenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:17">Luuqa 16:17</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ha kiitatappe guuxiya issi kiitaa menthiya oonikka qassi harata hessatho oothana mela tamaarssey oonikka salo kawotethan ubbaafe guutha gidana. Shin ha kiitaa poleysinne haratakka polana mela tamaarssey salo kawotethan gita gidana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ta hinttew odays; hintte xillotethay Farisaaweta xillotethaafenne higge asttamaareta xillotethaafe aadhdhonna ixxiko, salo kawotethaa gelekketa.</para>
  <para style="s">Wodhobaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Hintte mayzatas, ‘Wodhoppite; shemppo wodhida oonikka pirddettana’ geetettoyssa si7ideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Kessa 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Zaare 5:17</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin ta hinttew odays; ba ishaa hanqettiya ubbay pirddettana. Ba ishaa cayaa oonikka daynna sinthi pirddas shiiqana. Ba ishaakko, ‘Eeyay’ giya oonikka qassi gaanname taman pirddettana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, neeni ne yarshshuwa yarshshiya wode ne ishaa qohidabay new akeeketiko, <verse number="24" style="v"/>ne yarshshuwa he bessan aggada ba; koyrota bada ne ishaara giiga; yaata simmada, ne yarshshuwa Xoossaas yarshsha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Nena mooteyssara pirdda keethi bashe oge bolla iyara giiga. Hessi atto giikko I nena daynna sinthi efana. Daynnay nena qachcheyssas aathi immana; I nena woynen yeggana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ta tuma odays; ne bolla pirddettida accuwa issi santimey attonna cigga onggana gakkanaw qasho keethafe keyakka.</para>
  <para style="s">Laymatethabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Hayssafe kase, ‘Laymatoppite’ geetettoyssa si7ideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Kessa 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Zaare 5:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v"/>Shin ta hinttew odays, maccas xeellidi, amottida ubbay ba wozanan iira laymatees. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ne ushachcha ayfey new nagaras gaaso gidikko, kessa hola. Ne asatethay kumethi gaanname taman wodhdhanaappe ne asatethaafe issoy dhayikko new lo77o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:9">Maato 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:47">Mar 9:47</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ne ushachcha kushey new nagaras gaaso gidikko, iya qanxa hola. Ne asatethay kumethi gaanname taman wodhdhanaappe ne asatethaafe issoy dhayikko, new lo77o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:8">Maato 18:8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:43">Mar 9:43</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Machchi azina bilethabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Maato 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luuqa 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“ ‘Ba machchiw yeddiya oonikka anjjo worqqatiya immo’ geetettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:7">Maato 19:7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:4">Mar 10:4</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v"/>Shin ta hinttew odays; ba machchiya laymatonna de7ishin billiya ubbay iya laymatana mela oothees. Hessadakka, anjjettida maccasiw ekkiya ubbay laymatees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:9">Maato 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Mar 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luuqa 16:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10-11">1Qoro 7:10-11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Caaqobaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Hintte mayzatakko, ‘Worddon caaqqofite; hintte Xoossaa sinthan caaqqidayssa polite’ geetettidayssa si7ideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Leewe 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Tay 30:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:21">Zaare 23:21</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v"/>Shin ta hinttew odays; ubbarakka caaqqofite. Xoossay uttiya araata gidiya gisho, salon caaqqofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:22">Maato 23:22</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v"/>Iya tohoy yedhdhiya soo gidiya gisho, sa7ankka caaqqofite. Gita kawuwa katama gidiya gisho, Yerusalaamenkka caaqqofite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 48:2">Maz 48:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hintte binaanappe issuwaka boothi woykko kareethi oothanaw dandda7onna gisho, hinttee hintte huu7enkka caaqqofite. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hintte qaalay, ‘Ee’ woykko ‘Akkay’ gido. Hessafe kare keyey Xalaheppe yees.</para>
  <para style="s">Halo keyanaw koshshenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>“ ‘Ayfe gisho ayfe; achcha gisho achche’ geetettidayssa si7ideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:24">Kessa 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Leewe 24:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:19">Zaare 19:19</ref></char></note> <verse number="39" style="v"/>Shin ta hinttew odays; hintte bolla iitabaa oothiya uraara eqettofite. Oonikka ne ushachcha shakalaa baqqiko ne haddirssa shakalaakka bessa. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Issi asi ne shaamiziya ekkanaw nena mootikko, ne kootiya gujjada imma. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Issi asi nena wolqqan babaa toossidi issi saate oge baara baana mela nena un77ethiko, iyara nam77u saate oge ba. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Woossiya oodeskka imma; neeppe tal77anaw koyaa oonakka diggofa.</para>
  <para style="s">Ne morkketa siiqa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luuqa 6:27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“ ‘Nena doseyssa dosa; nena ixxeyssa ixxa’ geetettoyssa si7ideta. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Shin ta hinttew odays; hintte morkketa dosite; hinttena qoheyssatas woossite. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hessatho hintte oothiko, salon de7iya hintte aawas hintte nayta gidana. I iitatasinne lo77otas awa kessees; xillotasinne nagaranchchotas ba iraa bukisees. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Hinttena dosiya asaa xalaala hintte dosikko, hinttew ay woytoy de7ii? Hari attoshin, qaraxa qanxiseyssatikka hessa oothoosona. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Hinttee, hintte ishata xalaala sarothiko, haratappe ay hara aadhdhiyabaa oothidetii? Hari attoshin, Xoossaa ammanonna asaykka hessa oothoosona. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Hiza, salon de7iya hintte aaway polo gidoyssada hintteka polo gidite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Leewe 19:2</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:13">Zaare 18:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Manqotas imobaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Asi be7o gidi hintte lo77o oosuwa asa sinthan oothonnaada naagettite. Hessatho hanonna ixxiko salon de7iya hintte Aawappe woyto demmeketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:5">Maato 23:5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Hinttee manqotas immiya wode asa sinthan bonchchettanaw gidi cubboti ogiya doonaninne Ayhude Woosa Keethatan ootheyssada asi be7o gidi oothofite. Ta hinttew tuma odays; entti bantta kumetha woytuwa ekkidosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Shin hinttee manqotas immiya wode hintte ushachcha kushey ootheyssa hintte haddirssa kushey eroppo; <verse number="4" style="v"/>hintte imoy geeman gido. Geeman ootheyssa be7iya hintte aaway hinttew woytuwa qonccen immana.</para>
  <para style="s">Woosabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luuqa 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Woosa woossishe cubbotatho hanoppite. Entti, banttana asi be7o gidi Ayhude Woosa Keethaninne ogiya doonan eqqidi woosseyssa dosoosona. Ta hinttew tuma odays; entti bantta kumetha woytuwa ekkidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:10-14">Luuqa 18:10-14</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin neeni woossiya wode, ne soo gela, wulaa gorddada geeman de7iya ne Aawakko woossa; geeman oosettidayssa be7iya ne aaway new woytuwa immana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hintte woossiya wode Ayhude gidonna asaatho coo qaala darssidi woossofite. Entti adussi woossin Xoossay si7ees gidi qoppoosona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, enttayssada hanoppite. Ays giikko, hintte aaway hinttew ay koshshiyako hintte woossanaappe sinthattidi erees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Hiza, hintte yaagidi woossite,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Salon de7iya nu aawaw,</para>
  <para style="q1">ne geeshsha sunthay anjjetto.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ne kawotethay yo,</para>
  <para style="q1">ne sheney salon hanidayssada</para>
  <para style="q2">sa7ankka hano.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Gallasa kathaa hachchi hachchi nuus imma.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nuuni nuna qohidayssata, atto geyssada,</para>
  <para style="q2">nuuskka nu qohuwa atto ga.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nuna iitappe ashshafe attin</para>
  <para style="q2">paacen gelssofa.</para>
  <para style="q1">[Kawotethay, wolqqaynne bonchchoy</para>
  <para style="q2">merinaw neessa. Amin7i.]</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Hintte hinttena qohidayssata atto giikko, salon de7iya hintte Aaway hintte qohuwakka atto gaana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:14-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 11:25-26">Mar 11:25-26</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin hintte hara asa nagara atto goonna ixxiko hintte Aaway hintte nagara atto geenna.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoomabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Hintte xoomiya wode cubbotatho kayottofite. Ays giikko, entti xoomeyssa asi erana mela bantta som77uwa qitayoosona. Ta tuma odays; entti bantta woytuwa ekkidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>“Shin neeni xoomiya wode ne som77uwa meecca, ne huu7iya tiyetta. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hessada ne oothiko ne xoomiya xoomay asappe geemmidayssa, shin geeman de7iya ne Aaway eriya xooma gidana. Geeman oosettidayssa be7iya ne Aaway new woytuwa immana.</para>
  <para style="s">Salon shalo shiisho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Bili miyason, biraati shi7iyason, kaysoy bookkidi ekkiyason, ha sa7an, hinttew shalo shiishoppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:2">Yay 5:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shin bili moonason, biraati shi7onnason, kaysoy bookkidi ekkonnason salon hinttew shalo shiishite. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ne shaloy de7iyasuwan ne wozanay de7ana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Ayfey asatethaas xomppe. Hessa gisho, ne ayfey payya gidikko ne kumetha asatethay poo7o gidees. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ne ayfey hargganchcho gidikko ne kumetha asatethay dhuma gidees. Hiza, nenan de7iya poo7oy dhuma gidikko, dhumay ay mela aadhdhidi dhumanddeshsha!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Issi asi nam77u godas haarettanaw dandda7enna. Issuwa dosikko hankkuwa ixxees; woykko issuwa bonchchiko hankkuwa kadhees. Xoossasinne miishes haarettanaw dandda7ekketa.</para>
  <para style="s">Un7ettofite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luuqa 12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Hiza, si7ite! Hinttee de7on daanaw, ‘Ay maanee? Ay uyanee? Ay ma77anee?’ gidi un77ettofite; de7oy kathafe woykko ma7oppe aadhdhenee? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Salo kafota xeellite; entti zerokkona, buuccokona, shaalen yeggokona, shin hintte salo aaway entta muzees. Hinttee enttafe keehi aadhdheketii? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hintte giddofe daro un7ettidi ba laythaa bolla issi gallas gujjanaw dandda7ey de7ii?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Qassi hintte ma77iyabaas ays un7ettetii? Ane ciishshata be7ite, ooson daaburokkona woykko suqqokona. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Si7ite! Hari attoshin, kawuwa Solomoney ba bonchcho ubban ha ciishshatappe issuwa melakka ma77ibeenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:4-7">1Kawo 10:4-7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:3-6">2Taari 9:3-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hinttenoo, ammanoy paccidayssato, Xoossay hachchi benttidi wontto taman wodhdhanaw de7iya maata yaatidi mayziyabaa gidikko, hinttena enttafe aathidi waati mayzennee? <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ‘Ay maanee? Ay uyanee? Ay ma77anee?’ gidi un7ettofite. <verse number="32" style="v"/>He ubbaa Xoossaa ammanonna asay darssidi demmanaw un77ettoosona. Hintte salo aaway he ubbay hinttew koshsheyssa erees. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Shin ubbaafe sinthe Xoossaa kawotethaanne iya xillotethaa koyite; he ubbay hinttew gujji imettana. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, wonttos qoppishe un7ettofite. Wonttoyssi wonttos aqo; issi issi gallasay baw gidiya metora de7ees.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Harata bolla pirddofite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-42">Luuqa 6:37-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Hintte bolla pirddettonna mela harata bolla pirddofite. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ays giikko, harata bolla hintte pirddeyssada hintte bolla pirddettana; hintte haratas makkidaban hinttew zaari makettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:24">Mar 4:24</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ne ayfen de7iya tuussu daaneyssa be7onna ne ishaa ayfen de7iya buuriya ays be7ay? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ne ayfen tuussi de7ishin ne ishaa ayfen de7iya buuriya kesso gaanaw waana dandda7ay? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Neno cubbuwaw, koyrottada ne ayfen de7iya tuussi daaneyssa kessa. Iyappe guye, ne ishaa ayfen de7iya buuriya kessanaw ne geeshsha xeellana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Guye simmidi hinttena saxxonna mela geeshshabaa kanatas yeggofite. Bantta tohuwan yedhdhidi iissonna mela hintte al77o inquwa gudunthota sinthan yeggofite.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 2 fig*</para>
  <para style="s">Woossite, koyite, xeegite</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luuqa 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Woossite hinttew imettana, koyite hintte demmana, kare yidi xeegite hinttew dooyettana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Woossiya oodeskka imettana, koyaa oodeskka benttana, kare yidi xeegiya oodeskka dooyettenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Hintte giddofe ba na7i uythi woossiko shuchchi immey oonee? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Woykko molo woossiko shooshi immey de7ii? <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yaatin hintte iita gidishe hintte naytas lo77obaa imo erikko, hintte salo aaway bana woosseyssatas lo77obaa waati darssidi immenee? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Harati hinttew oothana mela hintte koyabaa ubbaa hintteka haratas oothite. Ays giikko, Muse higgeynne nabeti tamaarssey hayssa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:31">Luuqa 6:31</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Xuuntha wulara gelite; ays giikko, dhayos efiya ogey wogga, wulaykka dalgga. Iyara geliya asaykka daro. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin de7uwakko efiya ogeynne wulay xuunthu; yaa geliya asaykka guutha.</para>
  <para style="s">Mithi ba ayfen erettees</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43">Luuqa 6:43</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:44">44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Bolla baggara dorsse daanidi bantta gaathan suudhume gididi hintte giddo geliya worddanchcho nabetappe naagettite. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hintte entta, entta ayfiyaappe erana; agunthafe woyney, kinchchoteppe laadey maxettenna. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa mela lo77o mithi ubbay lo77o ayfe ayfees; iita mithi iita ayfe ayfees. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Lo77o mithi iita ayfe ayfenna, qassi iita mithi lo77o ayfe ayfanaw dandda7enna. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Lo77o ayfe ayfonna mithi ubbay qanxettidi taman xuugettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:10">Maato 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:9">Luuqa 3:9</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hintte entta, entta ayfiyaan erana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:33">Maato 12:33</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="rem">fig 3 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Salon de7iya ta aawa sheniya oothiya uray salo kawotethi gelanaappe attin coo tana ‘Godaw, Godaw’ giya ubbay salo kawotethi gelenna. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pirdda gallas daroti, ‘Godaw, Godaw, ne sunthan tinbbite odibookko? Ne sunthan tuna ayyaanata kessibookko? Ne sunthan malaatata oothibookkoo?’ yaagana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>He wode taani, ‘Ta hinttena ubbarakka erikke, hinttee iita ootheyssati taappe haakkite’ yaagana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 6:8">Maz 6:8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Hiza, ha ta qaala si7idi oothiya oonikka ba keethaa shuchcha bolla keexida wozanaama asa mela. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iray bukkis, di7oy di77is, carkkoyka carkkidi he keethaa sugis. Shin keethay shuchcha baaso bolla keexettida gisho kunddibeenna. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ha ta qaala si7idi oothonna oonikka ba keethaa shafe bolla keexida eeya uraa mela. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Iray bukkidi, di7oy di77idi, carkkoyka carkkidi, he keethaa sugin, he keethay kunddis; iya kunddethaykka wolqqaama” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba oda onggida wode iya timirttey higge asttamaareta mela gidonna maatara gidiya gisho asay iya timirttiyan malaalettidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:28-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:22">Mar 1:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:32">Luuqa 4:32</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi baro hargganchchuwa pathis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mar 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luuqa 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi deriyappe wodhdhiya wode daro asay iya kaallidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hekko issi baro hargganchoy iyaakko shiiqidi, iya sinthan gulbbatidi, “Godaw, ne shene gidikko tana geeshshada pathanaw dandda7aasa” yaagis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba kushiya yeddidi iya bochchidi, “Ee, ta shene, paxa” yaagis. Uray iirakka geeyi aggis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesuusi iyaakko, “Ne paxuwa oodeskka odoppa. Shin bada ne geeyada paxoyssa kahine bessa. Ne paxuwas markka gidana mela bada Musey kiittida yarshshuwa yarshsha” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1">Leewe 14:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Mato halaqaa ammanuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yesuusi Qifirnahoome katama gakkida wode, issi mato halaqay iyaakko shiiqidi, <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Godaw, ta aylley asatethay gunddin daro harggettidi, son zin77idi de7ees” yaagidi woossis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani bada iya pathana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin mato halaqay zaaridi, “Godaw, ne ta soo gelanaw bessiya asi gidikke, shin ne han uttada qaala xalaala oda, ta aylley paxana. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ays giikko, taappe bollara ta kiitettiya asati de7oosona, qassi taappe garssara taw kiitetteyssati de7oosona. Enttafe issuwa, ‘Ba’ giyade bees; hankkuwa qassi ‘Haaya!’ giyade yees. Ta aylliya, ‘Hayssa ootha’ giyade oothees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa si7ida wode malaalettidi, bana kaalliya asaakko, “Ta hinttew tuma odays; taani hayssa mela ammano Isra7eele asankka be7abiikke. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta hinttew odays; daroti dolohappenne wulohappe yidi, salo kawotethan Abrahamera, Yisaaqaranne Yayqoobara issife imato bolla uttana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:29">Luuqa 13:29</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Shin salo kawotethaa laattanaw bessishin attidayssati kare dhuman holettana. Yan enttaw yeehonne achcha garccethi gidana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:13">Maato 22:13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luuqa 13:28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesuusi mato halaqaakko, “Ne soo ba, ne ammanuwatho new hano” yaagis. Iya aylley sohuwara paxi aggis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi daro hargganchchota pathis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Mar 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luuqa 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesuusi Phexiroosa soo geliya wode, Phexiroosa machche aayiya qoxo misha harggen sakettada zin77idaaro be7is. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesuusi I kushiya bochchida wode qoxoynne mishay aggi aggis. Paxa denddada iya mokkasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>He wode omarssi tuna ayyaanan oykettida daro asata, asay Yesuusakko ehidosona. Ikka tuna ayyaanata ba qaalan kessis, hargganchchota ubbaa pathis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessankka nabiya Isayaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1">“I nu harggiya baw ekkis,</para>
  <para style="q2">i nu harggiya tookkis”</para>
  <para style="m">gida qaalay polettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:4">Isa 53:4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa kaaloy cigisiya gatiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luuqa 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesuusi daro asay iya yuushuwan eqqidayssa be7idi, abbaafe hefinthi pinnana mela ba tamaareta kiittis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Higge asttamaaretappe issoy, “Asttamaariyaw, ne biyaso ubbaa ta kaallana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Yesuusi iyaakko “Workkanatas olli de7ees, salo kafotas keethi de7ees. Shin Asa Na7aas ba huu7iya shemppisiya bessi baawa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesuusa kaalliya asatappe issoy, “Godaw, taani sinthata bada ta aawa moogada yaana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi, “Hayqqidayssati bantta hayqota moogo; neeni tana kaalla” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi hobbiya si7i oothis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mar 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luuqa 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi baanaw wogoluwan gelida wode, iya tamaaretikka iyara baanaw gelidosona. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Entti qopponna de7ishin, wolqqaama hobbey haatha bolla denddin wogoloy mitettanaw gakkis. Shin Yesuusi dhiskkis. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti iyaakko shiiqidi iya barkkethidi, “Godaw, nu dhayos nuna ashsharkkii” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Hinttenoo, ammanoy paccidayssato, ays yayyetii?” yaagis. Denddidi, hobbiyanne gotiya essis. Ellesidi ubbabay si7i gis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti malaalettidi, “Hayssi, hari attoshin, hobbeynne gotey kiitetteyssi waanida asee?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Tuna ayyaanay oykkida nam77u asata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mar 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luuqa 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesuusi abbaafe hefinthan de7iya Gerggesoone giya biittaa gakkida wode tuna ayyaanay oykkida nam77u asati duufoppe keyidi iyara gahettidosona. Entti daro iitanne yashshiya asata gidiya gisho asi he bessaara aadhdhanaw dandda7enna. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Enttika, “Xoossaa Na7aw, nunanne nenanne aybe gathey? Wodey gakkonna de7ishin nuna pirddanaw yadii?” gidi waassidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Enttafe daro haakkonna guduntho wudey heemettes. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Tuna ayyaanati Yesuusa, “Ne nuna kessanabaa gidikko, hini guduntho wudiya giddo yeddarkkii” yaagidi woossidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Biite” yaagis. Tuna ayyaanati asatappe keyidi gudunthotan gelidosona. Gudunthoti ubbay aafo doonara dirggidi bidi abban mitettidi hayqqidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Guduntho wudiya heemmeyssati baqatidi katama bidi, hanidabaanne tuna ayyaanay oykkida asata bolla oosettidaba ubbaa odidosona. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yaatin, kataman de7iya asay ubbay Yesuusa be7anaw keyis. Entti Yesuusa be7ida wode bantta biittaafe keyidi baana mela woossidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Gundda uraa paxuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mar 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luuqa 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi wogoluwan gelidi, abbaa pinnidi ba katamaa bis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Hanida guutha asati issi gundda uraa alggara tookkidi Yesuusakko ehidosona. Yesuusi entta ammanuwa be7idi, gundda uraa, “Ta na7aw, yayyofa! Ne nagaray atto geetettis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>He saatiyan, Ayhude higge asttamaaretappe issoti issoti, “Hayssi Xoossaa cashshe gidennee” yaagidi bantta wozanan qoppidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesuusi entta qofaa eridi, “Iitabaa hintte wozanan ays qoppeetii? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hanoshin, ‘Ne nagaray atto geetettis’ geyssafenne ‘Dendda eqqada ba’ geyssafe awussi kawuyii? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin sa7a bolla nagara atto gaanaw Asa Na7aas maati de7eyssa ta hinttena erisana” yaagidi, gundda addiyako, “Dendda eqqa, ne alggaa tookkada, ne soo ba” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Gundda uray denddidi ba soo bis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Derey hessa be7idi malaalettidosona. Hessa mela maata asas immida Xoossaa galatidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Maatoosa xeegetethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mar 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luuqa 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesuusi yaappe denddidi bishe Maatoosa geyssa qaraxa qanxisiya bessan uttidashin be7idi, “Tana kaalla” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Ikka denddidi kaallis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusi Maatoosa son gayta bolla uttidashin, qaraxa qanxisiya daro asatinne nagaranchchoti yidi iyaranne iya tamaaretara issife maanaw uttidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Luuqa 15:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v"/>Issi issi Farisaaweti hessa be7idi, Yesuusa tamaareta, “Hintte asttamaarey qaraxa qanxiseyssataranne nagaranchchotara ays mii?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa si7idi, “Dhale koshshey haragganchchotassafe attin paxatassa gidenna. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin hintte bidi, ‘Taani hintte yarshshuwa gidonnashin hintte harata maarana mela koyays’ geetettidi xaafettidayssi woy guusseeko erite. Ays giikko, taani nagaranchchota xeeganaw yasippe attin xillota xeeganaw yabiikke” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:7">Maato 12:7</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hose 6:6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi xoomabaa oyshettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mar 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luuqa 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>He wode Yohaannisa tamaareti Yesuusakko shiiqidi, “Nunne Farisaaweti xoomos, shin ne tamaareti ays xoomokkonaa?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi enttako, “Mushuray enttara de7ishin xeegettidi yida asay kayottanaw dandda7onna? Mushuray entta matappe ekettana wodey yaana, entti he wode xoomana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Ooratha ma7oppe peedhidi gal77a ma7o bolla sikkey oonikka baawa. Hessatho oothiko oorathay gal77aa peedhees. Peedhethayka gujji dalggees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ooratha woyne gal77a ogoron qoliya oonikka baawa. Hessatho oothiko ooratha woyney gal77a ogoruwa dhusees woyneykka gukkees; ogoroykka nam77antho maaddonnabaa gidees. Shin ooratha woyney ooratha ogoron qoletanaw bessees. Hessatho oosettiko nam77ayka iitonna naagettoosona” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Hayqqida na7iwunne Yesuusa afilaa bochchida maccasiw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mar 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luuqa 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa odo bolla de7ishin, Ayhude halaqatappe issoy iyaakko yidi, iya sinthan gulbbatidi, “Ta na7iya ha77i hayqqasu, shin iya paxana mela neeni yada ne kushiya I bolla wotharkkii” gidi woossis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yesuusi denddidi iyara bis; iya tamaaretikka kaallidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>I bishin tammanne nam77u laythi kumethi suuthi goggidi waaysiya issi maccasiya guyera shiiqada Yesuusa afilaa macaraa bochchasu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iya ba wozanan, “Ta iya afilaa macaraa xalaala bochchiyakko paxana” yaagada qoppasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesuusi guye simmi iyo xeellidi, “Ta naatte, yayyofa! Nena ne ammanoy pathis” yaagis. Maccasiya sohuwara paxa aggasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi Ayhude halaqaa soo gakkiya wode zaye punneyssatanne yeekkeyssata be7idi, <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Ane kichchite; guutha na7iya dhiskkasuppe attin hayqqabuukku” yaagis. Shin asay iya bolla miicidosona. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Asaa kare kessidaappe guye soo gelidi, na7ee kushiya oykkis, na7iya dendda eqqasu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>He worey he biitta ubbaa gakkis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi nam77u qooqeta xeelisis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yesuusi yaappe denddidi gede sinthe biya wode nam77u qooqeti bantta qaala dhoqqu oothidi, “Dawite na7aw, nuna maararkii” yaagishe iya kaallidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesuusi soo gelida wode qooqeti iya kaallidi yidosona. Yesuusi enttako, “Taani hessa oothanaw dandda7eyssa hintte ammaneetii” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Enttika, “Ee, Godaw” yaagidi zaaridosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi entta ayfiyaa bochchidi enttako, “Hinttew, hintte ammanuwatho hano” yaagis. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Entta ayfeykka dooyettis. Yesuusi enttako, “Hayssa oodeskka odoppite” yaagidi minthi odis. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Shin asati bidi Yesuusabaa he biitta ubban odidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Entti yaappe keyaa wode asay tuna ayyaanay oykkidi muumisida issi asi Yesuusakko ehidosona. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Tuna ayyaanay keyidaappe guye muume uray odettis. Dereykka malaalettidi, “Hayssa mela oorathabay Isra7eele biittan hanibeenna” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Shin Farisaaweti, “Tuna ayyaanata halaqan tuna ayyaanata kessees” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:25">Maato 10:25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mar 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luuqa 11:15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi asaas qadhettis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesuusi Ayhude Woosa Keethatan tamaarssishe, salo kawotethaa Wonggelaa sabbakishe, asaa hargge ubbaafe pathishe katamataninne guta ubban yuuyis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23">Maato 4:23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:39">Mar 1:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:44">Luuqa 4:44</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v"/>Daro derey, heemmiya asi baynna dorssada enttana be7iya asi dhayin un77ettidi de7eyssta be7idi enttaw qadhettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:17">Tay 27:17</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:17">1Kawo 22:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 18:16">2Taari 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Hiz 34:5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:34">Mar 6:34</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ba tamaaretakko, “Shiiqana kathay daro, shin kathaa shiishiya asay guutha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:37-38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:2">Luuqa 10:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, Goday kathaa shiishiya oosanchchota yeddana mela woossite” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi kiittida tammanne nam77u hawaareta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mar 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luuqa 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi tammanne nam77u tamaareta baakko xeegidi, tuna ayyaanata kessana melanne hargge ubbaa pathana mela enttaw maata immis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesuusi kiittida tammanne nam77u hawaareta sunthay: koyroy Phexiroosa giya Simoonanne iya ishaa Inddiriyasa, Zabdiyoosa na7a Yayqoobanne iya ishaa Yohaannisa, <verse number="3" style="v"/>Filiphphoosanne Bartolomiyoosa, Toomasanne qaraxa qanxisiya Maatoosa, Ilfiyoosa na7aa Yayqooba, Taadiyosa, <verse number="4" style="v"/>ba biittaas mishettiya Simoonanne Yesuusa aathi immida Asqoroota Yihuda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>He tammanne nam77ata Yesuusi kiittidi yeddishe, “Ayhude gidonna deriyakko booppite, qassi Samaareta katamakka geloppite. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin Isra7eele keethaafe gidida hini dhayida dorssatakko biite. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yaa bidi, ‘Salo kawotethay matattis’ gidi odite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7-15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-12">Luuqa 10:4-12</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hargganchchota pathite, hayqqidayssata hayqoppe denthite, baro hargganchchota geeshshi pathite, tuna ayyaanata kessite. Hintte coo ekkidayssa coo immite. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hintte kiisen worqqa, woykko bira santime oykkofite. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hintte ogiyas karxiito, nam77u afila, woykko caamma woykko xam77a oykkofite; oosanchchuwas gallasa kathi koshshees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:14">1Qoro 9:14</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 5:18">1Ximo 5:18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Hintte issi katamaa woykko gutaa geliya wode hinttena mokkidi ekkanaw ufayttiya uraa koyidi iya son shemppite; hintte baana gakkanaw yan gam77ite. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Qassi oode sookka gelishe sarothite. <verse number="13" style="v"/>He keethay hinttena mokkiko hintte sarothida saroy enttana gakko, shin entti mokkonna ixxiko hintte sarothida saroy hinttew guye simmo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Oonikka hinttena mokkonnanne hintte odiyabaa si7onna ixxiko he keethaafe woykko he katamaappe keyishe hintte tohuwan de7iya baana pittidi keyite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Ha@O 13:51</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ta hinttew tuma odays; Xoossaa pirdda gallasan he katamaappe Soodomesinne Gamoora katamatas pirdday kawuyana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:24">Maato 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 19:24">Medhe 19:24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Ta hinttena dorssatada suudhumeta giddo yeddana. Hessa gisho, shooshada cinccata, holleda ashkketa gidite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:3">Luuqa 10:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Asay hinttena pirdda daynnatas aathi immana, qassi Ayhude Woosa Keethan hinttena garaafana. Hessa gisho, enttafe naagettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17-20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:9-11">Mar 13:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11-12">Luuqa 12:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-15">21:12-15</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta gisho gidi hinttena deriya haareyssata sinthenne kawota sinthe efana. Entta sinthaninne Ayhude gidonna deriya sinthan eqqidi hintte tabaa markkattana. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Shin hinttena pirddas aathi immiya wode, woygidi zaarino gidi un77ettofite; he saatiyan hintte gaanabaa Xoossay hinttew immana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ays giikko, hinttenan haasayey hintte Aawa Geeshsha Ayyaanaappe attin hinttena gidekketa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Ishay ba ishaa, aaway ba na7aa, hayqos aathi immana, nayti banttana yelidayssata bolla denddidi enttana wodhisana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:12">Mar 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:16">Luuqa 21:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ta gisho gidi asay ubbay hinttena ixxana, shin wurssethi gakkanaw minniday attana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:9">Maato 24:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mar 13:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:17">Luuqa 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:13">Maato 24:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:13">Mar 13:13</ref></char></note> <verse number="23" style="v"/>Issi heerappe hinttena entti gooddiko hara katama baqatite. Taani hinttew tuma odays; Asa Na7ay yaana gakkanaw, hintte Isra7eele katama ubbaa kantheketa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Tamaarey ba asttamaariyappe, aylley ba godaappe aadhdhenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:40">Luuqa 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Yoha 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v"/>Tamaarey ba asttamaariya, aylley ba godaa daanikko iyaw gidana. Keethaawa Bi7elzebuula giikko iya soo asaa waanidi iissidi xeegenne?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Maato 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:24">12:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22">Mar 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:15">Luuqa 11:15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Hiza, asas yayyofite. Kamettidabay qoncconna, qosettidabay geeshshi keyonna attenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:22">Mar 4:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:17">Luuqa 8:17</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v"/>Taani hinttew dhuman odiyabaa hintte poo7on odite; ta hinttew haythan kalkkashidabaa dabaaban awaajjite. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ashoppe attin shemppo wodhanaw dandda7onnayssatas yayyofite. Shin shemppuwanne ashuwa gaannamen dhayssanaw dandda7iya Xoossaas yayyite. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nam77u buubbeti issi santimen bayzettokonaayye? Hanoppe attin, enttafe issinnaka hintte Xoossay goonna de7ishin sa7an wodhdhuku. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Hari attoshin, hintte huu7e binaanaykka paydettidi de7ees. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hiza, daro buubbetappe hintte aadhdhiya gisho yayyofite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Asa sinthan taw markkattiya ubbaas taanikka saluwan de7iya ta aawa sinthan markkattana. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Shin asa sinthan tana kaddeyssa taanikka salon de7iya ta aawa sinthan kaddana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Taani sa7an saro ehanaw yida hinttew daanoppo. Taani toorappe attin sarotethi ehanaw yabiikke. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Taani yiday,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Na7aa aawappe</para>
  <para style="q2">macca na7iw aayeppe</para>
  <para style="q1">na7aa machchiw azina aayeppe shaakkanaassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:35-36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7:6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Asas morkketi iya soo asata gidana.’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Taappe aathidi ba aawa woykko ba aayiw dosey, tabaa gidanaw bessenna. Ba adde na7a woykko ba macca na7iw taappe aathidi dosey, tabaa gidanaw bessenna. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ba masqaliya tookkidi tana kaallonna oonikka tabaa gidanaw bessenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:24">Maato 16:24</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:34">Mar 8:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luuqa 9:23</ref></char></note> <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ba shemppuwa ashshanaw koyey dhayssana, shin ba shemppuwa ta gisho aathi immey ashshana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:25">Maato 16:25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:35">Mar 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:24">Luuqa 9:24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoha 12:25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Hinttena mokkey tana mokkees, tana mokkey qassi tana kiittidayssa mokkees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luuqa 10:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Yoha 13:20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:37">Mar 9:37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:48">Luuqa 9:48</ref></char></note> <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nabiya nabe sunthan mokkey, nabiyatho woytettana; qassi xilluwa xillo sunthan mokkey, xilluwatho woytettana. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ta hinttew tuma odays; ha ta tamaaretappe guuxiya issuwas tana kaalliya gisho hari attoshin guutha irxxa haathi immiko iya woytoy dhayenna” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xammaqiya Yohaannisi kiittida asata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luuqa 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi tammanne nam77u tamaareta kiitaa onggidaappe guye yaappe denddidi tamaarssanawunne sabbakanaw Galiila katamata bis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yohaannisi qasho keethan de7ishe Kiristtoosi oothiyabata si7idi, ba tamaaretappe iyaakko kiittidi, <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Yaana geetettiday neneyye? Woykko nuuni haraa naaginoo?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako zaaridi, “Bidi hintte si7iyabaanne hintte be7iyabaa Yohaannisas odite. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Qooqeti xeellosona, wobbeti hamuttoosona, baro hargganchchoti paxoosona, tulleti si7oosona, hayqqidayssati hayqoppe denddoosona; manqotas Wonggelay sabbakettees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 35:5">Isa 35:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Tanan dhubettonay anjjettidayssa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yohaannisa tamaareti guye simmidi bin, Yesuusi deriyas Yohaannisabaa odishe, “Ha bazzuwa ay be7anaw keyidetii? Carkkoy qaathiya maqqaa be7anaw yidetiyye? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yaatin, ay be7anaw keyidetii? Kitte ma7o ma77ida ase be7anaaseyye? Kitte ma7o ma77idayssati kawota keethan de7oosona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yaatin, ay be7anaw keyidetii? Nabe be7anaaseyye? Hekko, hintte nabeppekka aadhdheyssa be7eeta.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Ne ogiya ne sinthan giigisiya</para>
  <para style="q2">ta kiitanchchuwa neeppe sinthe kiittana”</para>
  <para style="m">geetettidi xaafettiday iyassa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mil 3:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ta hinttew tuma odays; maccasappe yelettidayssata giddofe Yohaannisappe aadhdhey oonikka baawa; salo kawotethan ubbaafe guuxey I, iyappe aadhdhana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Xammaqiya Yohaannisa wodiyappe doomidi hachchi gakkanaw salo kawotethay daro naaqettees, minnida asati wolqqan yaa gelana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:16">Luuqa 16:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nabeti ubbaynne Muse higgey Yohaannisa wode gakkanaw salo kawotethaabaa tinbbite odidosona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte entta kiitaa ammanana gidikko, yaana geetettida Eliyaasi, I Yohaannisa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Mil 4:5; <ref loc="MAT 17:10">Maato 17:10</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hiza, si7iya haythi de7ey si7o.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Hiza, ha wodiya yeletethaa aybira daaniso? Giya giddon uttidi woli xeegidi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>‘Nu hinttew suusul77e punnin;</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte yexxeketa.</para>
  <para style="q">Nu sabbidi zeleelin;</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte yeekkeketa’</para>
  <para style="m">yaagiya nayta daanosona. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Xammaqiya Yohaannisi moonnanne uyonna yin, ‘Tuna ayyaani de7ees’ yaagideta. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Asa Na7ay mishenne uyishe yin, ‘Yarambbanne ushshanchcho, qaraxa qanxiseyssatanne nagaaranchchota dabbo’ yaagideta. Hiza, cinccatethaa tumatethay iya oosuwan qonccees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Ammanonna ixxida katamata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luuqa 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi daro malaatata oothida katamatan de7iya asati bantta nagaraappe simmidi maarotan gelonna ixxida gisho enttana, <verse number="21" style="v"/>“Ayye Koraaziine katamaw, ayye Beetesayda katamaw, ays giikko, hintte giddon oosettida malaatati Xiiroosaninne Sidoonan oosettida gidiyakko, entti beni bido tiyettidi, kalliiya ma7idi bantta nagaraappe simmi aggana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 23:1-18">Isa 23:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:1-28:26">Hiz 26:1-28:26</ref>; Iyu 3:4-8; <ref loc="AMO 1:9-10">Amo 1:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:2-4">Zakka 9:2-4</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin ta hinttew odays; pirdda gallas hinttefe aathidi Xiroosasinne Sidoonas pirdday kawuyana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Qassi, Qifirnahoome, neeni pude salo keyanaw koyay? Hanenna! Neeni Si7oolen yegettana. Ays giikko, ne giddon oosettida malaatati Soodomen oosettidabaa gidiyakko, Soodomey hachchi gakkanaw de7anashin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13">Isa 14:13</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shin ta new odays; pirdda gallas neeppe aathidi Soodomes pirdday kawuyana” yaagidi hanqettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:15">Maato 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:12">Luuqa 10:12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosan de7iya shemppo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luuqa 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>He wode Yesuusi, “Aawaw, saluwanne sa7aa Godaw, neeni hayssa eranchchotappenne cinccatappe genthada naytas qonccisida gisho, nena galatays. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ee, ta Aawaw, hayssi ne lo77o sheniyada hanis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Ubbay taw ta Aawappe imettis. Aawappe hari Na7a erey baawa, Na7aappenne I enttaw qonccisanaw koyeyssatappe hari Aawa eranaw dandda7ey baawa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:35">Yoha 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:18">Yoha 1:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Hinttenoo, daaburanchchoto, toohoy deexida ubbay taakko haa yiite; taani hinttena shemppisana. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Taani ta wozanan ashkkenne aada gidiya gisho, ta qambbaran gelite, taappe tamaarite; hinttee, hintte shemppuwas shemppo demmana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 6:16">Er 6:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ta qambbaray liiqo, qassi ta toohoykka kawushshe” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Sambbaata bonchchanaw bessii?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mar 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luuqa 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Sambbaata gallas, Yesuusi gade giddora aadhdhees. Yesuusa tamaareti koshattida gisho tiya bangga shirikidi moosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:25">Zaare 23:25</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Shin Farisaaweti hessa be7idi Yesuusakko, “Hekko, ne tamaareti Sambbaata gallas oothanaw bessonnabaa oothoosona” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako zaaridi, “Dawitey koshattida wode Iyara de7eyssatara ay oothidaakko nabbabibeekketii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1Saamu 21:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>Dawitey Xoossaa keethi gelidi kahineta xalaalappe attin inne iyara de7eyssatas bessonna geeshsha daabbuwa mis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Leewe 24:9</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Woykko kahineti Sambbaata wogaa shaaridi Xoossa Keethan Sambbaata gallas ooso oothiko enttaw bala gidonnayssa Muse higgiyan nabbabibeekketii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:9-10">Tay 28:9-10</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin si7ite! Xoossa Keethaafe aadhdhey hayssan de7ees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>‘Taani hintte yarshshuwa gidonnashin hintte harata maarana mela koyays’ giya qaalay woy guusseeko hintte eridaakko xillo asa bolla pirddeketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:13">Maato 9:13</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hose 6:6</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Asa Na7ay Sambbaata Godaa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesuusi yaappe bidi Ayhude Woosa Keethi gelis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yan kushey gunddida issi uray de7ees. Yesuusa mootanaw gaaso koyaa asati, “Sambbaata gallas pathanaw bessi bessennee?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>I enttako, “Hintte giddofe issuwas dorssi Sambbaata gallas aafon wulliko, goochchidi kessonnay oonee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:5">Luuqa 14:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yaatin asi dorssafe waanidi daro aadhdhenee? Hessa gisho, Sambbaata gallas lo77obaa oosoy bessees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi addiyako, “Ne kushiya piddi ootha” yaagin, uray piddi oothis. Iya kushey paxidi hankko kushiyada hanis. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin Farisaaweti yaappe kare keyidi, Yesuusa waati wodhaneekko maqettidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossay doorida aylliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesuusi entta qofaa eridi he bessaa aggidi hara soo bis. Daro asay iya kaallidi bidosona, hargganchchota ubbaa pathis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Tabaa hara oodeskka odoppite” yaagidi minthi odis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessika nabiya Isayaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Hekko ta doorida aylley,</para>
  <para style="q2">ta doseyssi, tana ufaysseyssi,</para>
  <para style="q1">taani ta ayyaanaa, iya bolla shemppisana;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Isa 42:1-4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">I, Ayhude gidonna deriyas suure pirddabaa awaajjana.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>I palamenna woykko kaccenna;</para>
  <para style="q2">ba qaalakka denbban coo sissenna.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Suure pirddan xoono demmana gakkanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">dinccettida maqqaa menthenna,</para>
  <para style="q2">cuyiya muqaadaa toysenna.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ayhude gidonna derey ubbay iyan ufayssi wothana”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagidi xaafidayssi polettana melassa.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusanne Bi7elzebuula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Mar 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luuqa 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, tuna ayyaanan oykettida qooqenne muume ase de7eyssa iyaakko ehidosona. Yesuusi uraa pathin, uray be7isinne odettis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Asa ubbay malaalettidi, “Hayssi Dawite Na7aa gidanddeshshaa?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Shin Farisaaweti hessa si7idi, “Ha uray tuna ayyaanata kessey tuna ayyaanata halaqaa Bi7elzebuula wolqqaana” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:34">Maato 9:34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:25">10:25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesuusi entta qofaa eridi, “Woli giddon shaakettiya kawotetha ubbay kunddana; qassi woli giddon shaakettiya katamay woykko keethay minnidi eqqenna. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Xalahey Xalahe kessiyabaa gidikko ba giddon shaakettis guussu. Hessatho haniyabaa gidikko iya kawotethay waanidi minnidi eqqanaw dandda7ii? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Taani tuna ayyaana kessey Bi7elzebuula wolqqan gidikko hinttena kaalliya asati oode wolqqan kessannee? Hessa gisho, hinttena kaalliya asati hinttena pirddana. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Shin taani tuna ayyaanata kessey Xoossaa Ayyaanan gidikko, Xoossaa kawotethay hintteko yis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Woykko issi asi wolqqaama asa soo gelidi iya shaluwa bonqanaw koykko koyrottidi he uraa qachchonna ixxiko waattidi dandda7ii? Yaatikko iya shaluwa bonqanaw dandda7ees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Taara gidonnay oonikka taara eqettees; qassi taara issife shiishonna ubbay laallees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 9:40">Mar 9:40</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, si7ite; asay oothiya ay nagarinne cashsha qaali ubbay atto geetettana, shin Geeshsha Ayyaana cayaa oodeskka iya nagaray atto geetettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31-32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luuqa 12:10</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v"/>Oonikka Asa Na7a bolla iitabaa odettiko iyaw atto geetettana, shin Geeshsha Ayyaana bolla iitabaa odettiya oodeskka ha sa7an gidin yaana alamiyan iya nagaray atto geetettenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luuqa 12:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Lo77o mithay lo77o ayfe ayfees; qassi iita mithay iita ayfees. Hiza, mithay erettey ba ayfiyaana. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hinttenoo, shoosha nayto, hintte iita gidishe waanidi lo77obaa odettanaw dandda7etii? Asi ba wozanan kumidabaappe doonan odettees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Maato 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:33">23:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luuqa 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:18">Maato 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:45">Luuqa 6:45</ref></char></note> <verse number="35" style="v"/>Lo77o asi ba wozanan wothida lo77obaappe, lo77obaa kessees; iita asi ba wozanan wothida iitabaappe, iitabaa kessees. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Shin si7ite, asay odettiya coo oda ubbaas pirdda gallas zaaro immana. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ays giikko, ne odettiya ne qaalan xillana; ne odettiya ne qaalay ne bolla pirddana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Malaata be7anaw shiiqida oyshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Mar 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luuqa 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, issi issi Farisaawetinne higge asttamaareti Yesuusakko, “Asttamaariyaw, neeni malaata oothada nuna bessa” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:1">Maato 16:1</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:11">Mar 8:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luuqa 11:16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ammanettonnanne iita yeletethay malaata koyees. Shin nabiya Yoonasa malaatappe hara malaati iyaw imettena.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:4">Maato 16:4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:12">Mar 8:12</ref></char></note> <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yoonasi gita molo ulon heedzu gallasinne heedzu qamma gam77idayssa mela Asa Na7ay heedzu gallasinne heedzu qamma biitta garssan gam77ana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:17">Yoha 1:17</ref></char></note> <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nanawe asay pirdda gallas denddidi ha yeletethaa bolla pirddana; ays giikko, entti Yoonasa sibkkatiya si7idi bantta nagaraappe simmidosona. Hekko, Yoonasappe aadhdheyssi hayssan de7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:5">Yoha 3:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="42" style="v"/>Pirdda gallas dugeha kawiya denddada ha yeletethaa bolla pirddana; ays giikko, iya Solomone cinccatethaa si7anaw biittaa gaxappe yasu. Hekko, Solomoneppe aadhdhey hayssan de7ees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-10">1Kawo 10:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 9:1-12">2Taari 9:1-12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Tuna ayyaanay asappe keyidaappe guye baw shemppiyaso koyidi haathi baynna mela bessan daaburees, shin ba koyaa shemppuwa demmenna. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Yaanin, ‘Ta agga keyida keetha simmada baana’ yaagees. I simmiya wode keethay kaysi gideyssanne pitettidinne giigi uttidayssa demmees. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hiza, simmi bidi, baappe iitiya hara laappun iita ayyaanata ekkidi yees; enttika uraa giddo gelidi de7oosona. He uraas kaseyssafe guyeyssi daro iitees. Ha iita yeletethaa bolla hessa mela hanana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa aayiwunne iya ishata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mar 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luuqa 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesuusi deriyas oda bolla de7ishin iya aayiyanne iya ishati iya odisanaw koyidi karen eqqidosona. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Issi asi iyaakko, “Ne aayiyanne ne ishati nena odisanaw koyidi karen eqqidosona” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ta aayiya oonee? Ta ishatikka oonantee?” yaagis. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ba kushiyara tamaareta mallishe, “Be7ite, ta aayanne ta ishati hayssata. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Salon de7iya ta Aawa sheniya oothiya ubbay ta isha, ta michchonne ta aayo” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Zerethi zeriya uraa leemiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Mar 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luuqa 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He gallas Yesuusi sooppe keyidi abbaa gaxan uttis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Daro derey iya yuushuwan shiiqin asaa abbaa gaxan aggaagidi wogolon gelidi uttis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:1">Luuqa 5:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v"/>Asaas darobaa leemisora yaagidi odis;</para>
  <para style="p">“Issi goshshanchchoy zerethi zeranaw keyis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>I zeriya wode issi issi zerethati oge gaxan wodhdhidosona; enttaka kafoti yidi maxi midosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Issi issi zerethati garssan shaalloy de7iya biitta bolla wodhdhidosona. Daro biitti baynna gisho ellesidi dolis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Shin away keyin shullis; xaphoy baynna gisho melis. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Issi issi zerethay aguntha giddon wodhdhis; agunthay diccidi he dolaa cuullis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Harati qassi aradda biitta bolla wodhdhis; dolidi ayfe ayfis. Issoy xeeta, issoy usuppun tamma, issoy qassi hasttama ayfis. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Si7iya haythi de7iya uray si7o” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusa tamaareti iyaakko shiiqidi, “Ays neeni deriyas leemisora oday?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>I zaaridi, “Hinttew salo kawotethaa xuuraa eray imettis, shin enttaw imettibeenna. <verse number="12" style="v"/>De7iya ubbaas guzhettana, iyaw darana, shin baynnayssafe hari attoshin iyaw de7iyarakka ekettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:29">Maato 25:29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luuqa 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">19:26</ref></char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, taani entti, xeellishe demmonna mela, si7ishe si7onna mela woykko akeekonna mela enttaw leemison odays.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Isayaasi ba maxaafan odidayssi entta bolla polettis. I odishe,</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Hintte sissaa si7eeta, shin akeekekketa;</para>
  <para style="q2">hintte xeelleta, shin be7ekketa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ays giikko, ha asaa wozanay zel77umis;</para>
  <para style="q2">bantta haythaa erishe tullisidosona,</para>
  <para style="q1">bantta ayfiyaa goozidosona.</para>
  <para style="q2">Hessi baynneeko entti bantta ayfiyaan be7idi,</para>
  <para style="q1">bantta haythan si7idi,</para>
  <para style="q1">bantta wozanan akeekidi,</para>
  <para style="q2">taakko simmana,</para>
  <para style="q2">takka entta pathanashin’</para>
  <para style="m">yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Shin hintte ayfeti be7iya gishonne hintte haythati si7iya gisho hintte anjjettidayssata.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:23-24">Luuqa 10:23-24</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ta hinttew tuma odays; daro nabetinne xilloti hintte be7eyssa be7anawunne hintte si7eyssa si7anaw amottidosona, shin enttaw hanibeenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Hiza, ha zerethaa zeriya uraa leemisuwa si7ite. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Oge gaxan wodhdhida zerethaa leemisoy hayssa: salo kawotethaa qaala si7idi akeekonna uraa wozanappe Xalahey yidi iya wozanan de7iya zerethaa maxi digees. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shaalloy garssan de7iya biitta bolla zerettidayssi qaala si7idi ellesidi ufaysan ekkeyssata. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Shin xapho yeddanaw dandda7onna gisho daro gam77okona. Qaala gaason metoy woykko goodetethi yaa wode ellesi dhubettoosona. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Aguntha gaathan zerettidayssi qaala si7is, shin ha alamiya duussaa hirggaynne duretetha qofay qaala cuulliya gisho ayfe ayfonna attees. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shin aradda biittan zerettida zerethay akeekan qaala si7iya uraa. I ayfe ayfees; issoy xeeta, issoy usuppun tamma issoy qassi hasttama ayfees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Leeshshuwa leemiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttaw hara leemiso odis, “Xoossaa kawotethay ba goshshan lo77o zerethi zerida uraa daanees. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin asi ubbay dhiskkin iya morkkey yidi gisttiya giddon leeshsho zeridi bis. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Gisttey diccidi ayfiyaa wode leeshshoy iya giddon benttis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Gadiya godaa aylleti godaakko bidi, ‘Godaw, ne goshshan ne lo77o zerethi zerabikkishsho? Yaatin, leeshshoy awuppe yidee?’ yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“I enttako, ‘Hessa morkkey oothis’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">“Aylleti godaakko, ‘Nu bidi leeshshuwa shoddana mela koyay?’ yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Shin I, ‘Atto bochchofite; hintte leeshshuwa shoddays gishin gisttey shodettana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Bochchofite; caka wodey gakkanaw issife dicco. He wode cakkiya asata leeshshuwa sinthattidi maxidi taman xuugganaw mirqen mirqen qachchite. Shin gisttiya shiishidi ta shaaliyan qolite’ yaagana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Guutha mithee leemiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mar 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luuqa 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Qassi hara leemiso yaagidi odis; “Salo kawotethay issi asi ba goshshan bakkida guutha mithee ayfe daanees. <verse number="32" style="v"/>He mithee ayfey hara mitha ayfetappe guutha, shin iya dolaa diccida hara mithata ubbaafe aadhdha gitatawusu. I tashiyan kafoti keexidi uttana gakkanaw wolqqaama mithi gidawusu” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Irshsho leemiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luuqa 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kaallidikka, Yesuusi hara leemiso odis; “Salo kawotethay issi maccasi heedzu gabate dhiille ekka munuqada, munuqay denddana mela iyan gujjida irshsho daanees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesuusi deriyas he ubbaa leemisuwa odis. Leemisoy baynna issibaakka odibeenna. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Nabey ba maxaafan,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Taani ta doona, leemison dooyana;</para>
  <para style="q1">saloynne sa7ay medhettosappe,</para>
  <para style="q2">geemmidayssa odays”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagidi odidayssi hessan polettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:2">Maz 78:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Leeshsho leemisuwa birshethaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yesuusi deriya moyzidi soo gelis. Iya tamaareti iyaakko shiiqidi, “Goshshan de7iya leeshshuwa birshshethaa nuus oda” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>I zaaridi, “Lo77o zerethaa zeriday Asa Na7a. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Goshshay ha alamiya. Lo77o zerethay salo kawotethaa nayta. Leeshshoy Xalahe nayta. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Leeshshuwa zeriday morkkiya Xalahe. Caka wodey, wodiya wurssethaa. Cakkeyssati kiitanchchota.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Leeshshoy maxettidi taman xuugetteyssa mela wodiya wurssethan hessada hanana. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Asa Na7ay ba kiitanchchota kiittana. Entti nagaras gaaso gideyssatanne iita oothiya ubbaa maxidi iya kawotethaafe kessana. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Maxi shiishidi yeehoynne achcha garccethi de7iya to7onna taman yeggana. <verse number="43" style="v"/>He wode xilloti bantta Aawa kawotethan awada poo7ana. Si7iya haythi de7ey si7o!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“Xoossaa kawotethay goshshan moogettida miishe daanees. Issi asi he miishiya demmidi zaari moogis. Daro ufayttidi bidi baw de7iyaba ubbaa bayzidi he goshsha gadiya shammis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>“Hessadakka, qassi salo kawotethay inqo giya al77o shuchchata koyaa zal77anchcho daanees. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Daro al77o inquwa demmidi bidi baw de7iyaba ubbaa bayzidi iya shammis.</para>
  <para style="s">Molo oykkiya gite leemiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>“Qassi Xoossaa kawotethay abban yegettida dumma dumma qommo molo oykkiya gitiya daanees. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Molo oykkiya asati moloy gitiyan kumin abbaafe gaxa kessidosona. Yan uttidi lo77uwa qori qori daachcho yeggidosona, shin iita molota wora holidosona. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Wodiya wurssethan hessatho hanana. Kiitanchchoti yidi nagaranchchota xillotappe shaakkidi, <verse number="50" style="v"/>yeehoynne achcha garccethi de7iya to7onna taman yeggana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>“Ha ubbay hinttew gelidee?” yaagidi entta oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti zaaridi, “Ee” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Hiza, salo kawotethaa eraa ekkidi higgiya tamaarssiya ubbay, ba minjjida shaluwappe oorathaanne gal77a kessiya ase daanees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Naazireten ixettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Mar 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luuqa 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Yesuusi ha leemisuwa odi wurssidaappe guye yaappe denddidi bis. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Ba yelettida biittaa bidi Ayhude Woosa Keethan deriya tamaarssis. Entti malaalettidi, “Ha uray ha cinccatethaanne ha malaatata oothiya wolqqaa awuppe ekkidee? <verse number="55" style="v"/>Hayssi anaaxiya na7aa gidenneyye? Iya aaye sunthay Mayraamo gidennee? Iya ishati Yayqooba, Yoosefa, Simoonanne Yihuda gidokkonaayye? <verse number="56" style="v"/>Iya michcheti nuura de7oosona gidennee? Yaatin, ha uray ha ubbaa awuppe ekkidee?” yaagidosona. <verse number="57" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, I giyabaa ekkonna ixxidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:57 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:43">Yoha 4:43</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">Shin Yesuusi, “Nabey ba yelettida biittaninne ba soo asaa matan bonchchettenna” yaagis. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Entti ammanonna ixxida gisho daro malaatata he bessan oothibeenna.</para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Xammaqiya Yohaannisa hayquwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Mar 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luuqa 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He wode Galiila aysiya Heroodisi <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Heroodisi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hayssi kawuwa Herodis Antiphaasa. I Yihudanne Peeriya Kiristtoosi yelettanaappe sinthe 4-39 M@L@ gakkanaw haaris. I Kawuwa Heroodisas na7a.</char></note> Yesuusabaa si7is. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ba aylletakko, “Hayssi Xammaqiya Yohaannisa; I hayqoppe denddis. Yaanida gisho ha ubbaa malaatata I oothees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>I hessa giday Heroodisi ba ishaa Filiphphoosa machche Heerodiyadi gaason Yohaannisa qasho keethi gelssida gishossa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yohaannisi Heroodisa, “Ne iyo ekkanaw woga gidenna” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:19-20">Luuqa 3:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:16">Leewe 18:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20:21</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Heroodisi Yohaannisa wodhanaw koyis, shin derey Yohaannisa nabe oothidi be7iya gisho yashettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Heroodisi ba yelettida gallasa bonchchiya wode, Herodiyadi na7iya asaa sinthan yethan durada iya ufayssasu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yaatin, I, “Iya koyaba ubbaa immana gidi” caaqqis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Na7iya ba aaye zoriya si7ada Heerodisakko, “Xammaqiya Yohaannisa huu7iya keren wothada taw imma” yaagasu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Iya yaagin kawoy qiirottis, shin ba caaquwa gishonne baara de7iya imathata gisho gidi I oyshay polettana mela kiittis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kawoy ase kiittidi Yohaannisi qasho keethan de7ishin iya qoodhiya goyrisis. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Huu7iya keren wothi ehidi na7ees immidosona; na7iyakka ekkada ba aayes efasu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yohaannisa tamaareti yidi iya ahaa efidi moogidosona. Iyappe guye hanidabaa ubbaa bidi Yesuusas odidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ichchashu mukulu asaa muzis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mar 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luuqa 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yoha 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesuusi hanidabaa si7ida wode wogoluwan gelidi he bessaafe issi geemmiya soo barkka bis. Asay hessa si7idi katamatappe denddidi tohon iya kaallidosona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesuusi wogoluwappe wodhdhidi daro asaa be7idi enttaw qadhettis. Entta giddon de7iya hargganchchota pathis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Sa7ay omarssishe biya wode Yesuusa tamaareti iyaakko shiiqidi, “Ha bessay asi baynna bessi, sa7aykka qammis. Yaaniya gisho, heeran de7iya gutata bidi banttaw shammidi maana mela deriya yedda” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi enttako, “Derey moonna baanaw koshshenna; entti maanabaa hintte immite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi, “Nuus hayssan ichchashu uythaafenne nam77u moloppe hari baawa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ikka, “Ane entta haa ehite” yaagis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kaallidikka, derey maatan uttana mela odis. Ichchashu uythaanne nam77u molota ekkidi, salo xeellidi galati simmidi, uythaa menthidi ba tamaaretas immis; entti qassi deriyas immidosona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ubbay midi kallidosona. Yesuusa tamaareti mishin attidayssa tammanne nam77u gayta denthidosona. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kathaa mida asay maccasaynne nayti attin ichchashu mukulu gidees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi abbaa bollara hamuttis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mar 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yoha 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba tamaareti wogoluwan gelidi baappe sinthattidi abbaafe he finthi pinnana mela kiittidi baw deriya moyzanaw guye attis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Deriya moyzi simmidi barkka woossanaw issi deriya bolla keyis. Sa7ay qamminkka I barkka yan gam77is. <verse number="24" style="v"/>He wode wogoloy abbaa bolla bishin sintha baggara carkkoy denddin hobbey wogoluwa un77ethis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Wonttimaatha bolla Yesuusi abbaa bolla hamuttishe ba tamaaretakko yis. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti, I abbaa bolla hamuttishe banttako yeyssa be7idi yayyidosona. Enttika, “Hayssi moytille” gidi yayyidi waassidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi ellessidi, “Aykkoy baawa! Yayyofite! Tanabay” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Phexiroosi iyaakko, “Godaw, nena gidikko, taani haatha bollara hamuttada neekko baana mela tana kiitta” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesuusi Phexiroosakko, “Haaya” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Phexiroosi wogoluwappe wodhdhidi haatha bollara hamuttishe Yesuusakko buussu oykkis. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Shin wolqqaama carkkuwa be7idi yayyis. Haathan mitetethi oykkida wode, “Godaw, tana ashsharkkii” yaagidi waassis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Yesuusi ellesidi ba kushiya yeddi iya oykkidi, “Neno, ammanoy paccidaysso ays sidhay” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesuusaranne Phexiroosara wogoluwan gelida wode carkkoy si7i gis. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Wogoluwa giddon de7iya iya tamaareti, “Neeni tumakka Xoossaa Na7a” gidi goynnidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Entti abbaa pinnidi Gensareexe giya biittaa gakkidosona. <verse number="35" style="v"/>He biittan de7iya asay Yesuusa erida wode bantta heeran de7iya guta ubbaa kiita yedidosona. Asay hargganchchota ubbaa iyaakko ehidosona. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hargganchchoti iya afila macaraa xalaala bochchana mela woossidosona. Bochchida ubbayka paxidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Aawata wogabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Mar 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, issi issi Farisaawetinne higge asttamaareti Yerusalaameppe Yesuusakko yidi, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Ne tamaareti ays nu aawata wogaa menthonaa? Entti kathi maanappe sinthe bantta kushiya meecettokona” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hinttee, hintte wogaa gisho, Xoossaa kiitaa poleyssa ays ixxeeti? <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ays giikko, Xoossay, ‘Ne aawanne ne aayiw bonchcha. I ba aawa woykko ba aayiw cayeyssi hayqo gibeennee?’ yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kessa 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Zaare 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">Kessa 21:17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:9">Leewe 20:9</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shin hintte, issi asi ba aawa woykko ba aayiw maaddanabay de7ishin, ‘Hayssa ta Xoossas yarshshas giikko, <verse number="6" style="v"/>ba aawa woykko ba aayiw bonchchanaw bessenna’ yaageeta. Yaatidi hinttee, hintte wogaa polanaw Xoossaa qaala mentheeta. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hinttenoo, cubboto, Isayaasi hinttebaa likke odis,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Ha asay tana bantta doonan bonchchees,</para>
  <para style="q2">shin entta wozanay taappe haahon de7ees.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Asay tana coo goynnosona;</para>
  <para style="q2">entti asi medhdhida kiitaa</para>
  <para style="q2">Xoossaa higge daanisidi tamaarssoosona” gis’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Ase tunisiyabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Mar 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusi daro asaa baakko xeegidi, “Si7ite! Akeekite! <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ase tunisiyabay doonara geliyaba gidonnashin doonappe keyaabaa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusa tamaareti iyaakko yidi, “Farisaaweti neeni gidayssa si7idi dhubettidayssa akeekay?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi enttaw zaaridi, “Saluwan de7iya ta aaway tokkiboonna mithay ubbay shodettana. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Enttabaa hirggofite; entti qooqe kaalethiya qooqeta. Qooqey qooqe kaalethiko, nam77ayka ollan kunddana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:39">Luuqa 6:39</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Phexiroosi zaaridi, “Ha leemisuwa birshshethaa nuus odarkkii” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Hinttewuka ha77i gakkanaw gelibeennee? <verse number="17" style="v"/>Doonara geliyabaa ubbay ulo gelidi kare keyeyssa erekketii? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Shin doonara keyaabay wozanappe keyees. Ase tunisiyabati hessata.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:34">Maato 12:34</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v"/>Enttika asa wozana giddofe keyaa iita qofa, wodho, laymatethi, iita ooso, kayso, worddo markka, cashshe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessa daaniyabati ase tuniseesippe attin meecettonna kushera meyssi tunisenna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Issi maccase ammanuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Mar 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi yaappe keyidi Xiiroosanne Sidoona katamati de7iya biittaa bis. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Issi Kanaane biitta maccas Yesuusakko yada, ba qaalaa dhoqqu oothada, “Godaw, Dawite na7aw, taw qadhettarkii; ta na7iw tuna ayyaanay oykkidi iita waayses” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi issi qaalakka zaaronna si7i gis. Yesuusa tamaareti iyaakko yidi, “Ha maccasiya nu geedo kaalla kaallada, woossawusu. Hessa gisho, neeni iyo moyzarkkii” yaagidi woossidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani Isra7eele keethaafe wudeppe dhayida dorssatada dhayida asata xalaalas kiitettas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin iya sinthan kunddada, “Godaw, tana maaddarkii?” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>I zaaridi, “Nayta kathi ekkidi kanatas yeggeyssi lo77o gidenna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Maccasiyakka, “Godaw, hessi tuma, shin hari attoshin kanati bantta godati mishin, gaytappe wodhdhiya tiifiya moosona” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ha maccasete, ne ammanoy gita; ne koyidayssada new hano” yaagis. I na7iya iirakka paxa aggasu.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi daro hargganchchota pathis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesuusi yaappe denddidi Galiila Abbaa mati bis. Issi dere bolla keyidi, yan uttis. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Daro asay banttara, wobbeta, qooqeta, kuunata, doona muumetanne, hara daro hargganchchota ekkidi, iyaakko ehidi iya sinthan wothidosona. Yesuusi enttana pathis. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, muumeti odettishin, kuunati piddi gishin, wobbeti hamuttishin, qooqeti xeellishin asay be7idi malaalettidi, Isra7eeleta Xoossaa galatidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi oyddu mukulu asaa muzis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Mar 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba tamaareta baakko xeegidi, “Ha daro asay taara heedzu gallas gam77ida gishonne enttaw ha77i miyabay baynna gisho taani enttaw qadhettays. Entti ogen daaburidi kunddonna mela aykko muzonna entta mela yeddanaw koyikke” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti zaaridi, “Nuuni ha bazzuwan hayssa keena asaas gidiya kathi awuppe demmanee?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Hinttew aappun uythi de7ii?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti zaaridi, “Laappun uythinne laafa molotappe guuthi de7ees” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Yesuusi deriya sa7an uttite yaagidi kiittis. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, he laappun uythaanne moluwa ekkidi Xoossaa galatis. Menthidi ba tamaaretas immis. Iya tamaareti daro asaas gishidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Asay ubbay midi kallidosona. Mishin attida tiifiya laappun gita gayta kumethi iya tamaareti denthidosona. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Mida asay maccasinne na7a paydonna adde xalaali oyddu mukulu. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Yesuusi deriya yeddidaappe guye wogoluwan gelidi Megedoona giya biittaa bis.</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Saloppe malla be7anaw oychchida oysha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Mar 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luuqa 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Farisaawetinne Saduqaaweti Yesuusakko yidosona. Iya paaccanaw koyidi, banttana saloppe malaata besso gidi oychchidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:38">Maato 12:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luuqa 11:16</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Shin I enttako, “Sa7i omarssiya wode, ‘Saloy zo77ida gisho wontto booqallana’ yaageta. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Wonttiya wode, ‘Saloy zo77idi shaaratida gisho iray bukkana’ yaageta. Yaatin hintte salo mallaa be7idi ereeta, shin wodiya malla eranaw dandda7ibeekketa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Iitanne ammanonna yeletethay malaata koyees. Shin iyaw Yoonasa malaatappe hara malaati imettenna” yaagis. Hessafe guye, enttana yan aggidi hara soo bis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Maato 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luuqa 11:29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Farisaawetanne Saduqaaweta irshshuwaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Mar 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Entti abbaafe he finthi pinnida wode daabbo ekkidi yaanayssa dogidosona. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Farisaawetappenne Saduqaaweta irshshuwaafe naagettite” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luuqa 12:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="7" style="v"/>Enttika bantta garssan, “I hessa giday nu daabbo ekkidi yoonna gishossa gidana” yaagidosona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesuus entta qofaa eridi, “Hinttenoo, ammanoy paccidayssato! Daabbo ekkonna yida gisho woli gidon ays odetteetii? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ha77ika hintte akeeketii? Ichchashu mukulu asaas ichchashu uythaa gishidayssanne entti midi kallin hintte aappun gayta kumethi denthidaakko dogidetii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:17">Maato 14:17</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hessadakka, laappun uythaa oyddu mukulu asaas gishidayssanne entti midi kallin, hintte aappun gita gayta kumethi denthidaakko akeekekketii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:34">Maato 15:34</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hiza, taani Farisaawetanne Saduqaaweta irshshuwaafe naagettite gada odeyssi daabbobaa gidonnayssa akeekekketii?” yaagis. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yaatin, iya tamaareti Yesuusi odey munuqa denthanaw yegettiya irshshobaa gidonnashin Farisaawetanne Saduqaaweta timirttiyafe naagettanayssa gideyssa akeekidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosi Yesuusabaa odis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mar 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luuqa 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesuusi Qisaariya Filphoosa giya biittaa gakkida wode ba tamaareta, “Asay, Asa na7aa oona goonaa?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Enttika, “Issoti issoti Xammaqiya Yohaannisa, harati Eliyaasa qassi hankkoti Ermmiyasa woykko nabetappe issuwa goosona” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:1">Maato 14:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Yaatin, hintte tana oona geeti” gidi entta oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Simoona Phexiroosi zaaridi, “Neeni Kiristtoosa, de7o Xoossaa na7a” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:68">Yoha 6:68</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusi Phexiroosakko, “Yoona na7aa Simoona, neeni anjjettidayssa! Hayssa new qonccisiday saluwan de7iya ta aawappe attin ase gidenna. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ta new odays Phexiroosa, neeni zaalla! Taani ha zaalla bolla ta woosa keethaa keexana. Hayqo wolqqatika iyo xoonokkona. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Salo kawotethaa qulppeta ta new immana. Sa7an neeni diggiyabay ubbay salon Xoossaa matan digettidabaa gidana. Sa7an neeni hano giyabay ubbay salon Xoossaa matan hanidabaa gidana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:18">Maato 18:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Yoha 20:23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, I, Kiristtoosa gideyssa oodeskka odonna mela ba tamaareta minthidi kiittis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi bana gakkana waayiya odis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>He wodiyappe doomidi Yesuusi ba tamaaretas, “Taani Yerusalaame baanaw bessees. Yan deriya cimatan, kahine halaqatanne higge asttamaareta kushen waaye ekkanaw bessees. Entti tana wodhana, shin taani heedzantho gallas hayqoppe denddana” yaagidi qonccisis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Phexiroosi Yesuusa gaxa kessidi, “Godaw, hessi hanenna! Hessa melabay nena ubbarakka gakkofo!” yaagidi hanqettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi Phexiroosakko guye simmidi, “Ha Xalahiyaw, taappe haakka! Neeni asa qofa qoppasappe attin Xoossaa qofa qopponna gisho taw dhube gidaasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko, “Oonikka tana kaallanaw koyabaa gidikko bana kaddo, ba masqaliya tookkidi tana kaalo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Maato 10:38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luuqa 14:27</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ba de7uwa ashshanaw koyaa ubbay dhayssees. Shin ba de7uwa ta gisho gidi aathi immeyssi ashshees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Maato 10:39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luuqa 17:33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Yoha 12:25</ref></char></note> <verse number="26" style="v"/>Asi alame kumethaa baw oothidi, gidoshin ba shemppuwa dhayssikko iya ay maaddii? Woykko asi ba shemppuwa laame ay immanaw dandda7ii? <verse number="27" style="v"/>Asa na7ay ba aawa bonchchuwan ba kiitanchchotara yaana. He wode issi issi uraas iya oosuwada immana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Maato 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Maz 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Roome 2:6</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ta tuma odays; hayssan eqqida asatappe Asa Na7ay kawo gididi simmeyssa be7ana gakkanaw hayqonnayssati hayssan de7oosona” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa malay laamettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Mar 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luuqa 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Usuppun gallasappe guye Yesuusi, Phexiroosa, Yayqoobanne iya ishaa Yohaannisa baara ekkidi banttarkka gidanaw deriya bolla keyis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:17-18">2Phexi 1:17-18</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yan entta sinthan Yesuusa malay kumethi laamettis; iya som77oyka awada xolqqis. Iya ma7oykka daro booxis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hekko, Museynne Eliyaasi iyara odettishin be7idosona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Phexiroosi Yesuusakko, “Nuuni hayssa hashshu yida. Ne koykko issino new, issino Muses, issino Eliyaasas hayssan heedzu shaqara shaqarana” yaagis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Phexiroosi hessa buroo odishin bootha shaaray enttana kammis. Shaara giddora, “Tana ufayssiya, ta dosiya na7ay hayssa, iya si7ite!” yaagiya qaalay yis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:2">Medhe 22:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Maz 2:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Isa 42:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Maato 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12:18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mar 1:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luuqa 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Zaare 18:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesuusa tamaareti hessa si7ida wode dagammidi bantta som77uwara sa7an kunddidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi enttako shiiqidi entta bochchidi, “Denddite, yayyofite!” yaagis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Entti dhoqqu gidi be7ida wode Yesuusappe hara oonakka be7ibookkona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Entti deriyappe wodhdhishin Yesuusi enttako, “Asa Na7ay hayqoppe denddana gakkanaw ha hintte be7idabaa oodeskka odoppite” gidi kiittis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusa tamaareti, “Yaatin, higge asttamaareti Eliyaasi Kiristtoosappe kasetidi yaana giday aybisse?” yaagidi oychchidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Mil 4:5</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ee! Eliyaasi kaseti yidi ubbabaa giigisana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Shin ta hinttew tuma odays; Eliyaasi kasetidi yis. Enttika iya bolla koyidabaa oothidosonappe attin iya shaakki eribookkona. Hessada Asa Na7ay entta kushen waayettana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Maato 11:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>He wode Yesuusi giday Xammaqiya Yohaannisabaa gideyssa akeekidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi tuna ayyaanay oykkida na7aa pathis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Mar 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luuqa 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Entti deriyappe asaakko simmiya wode issi asi Yesuusa sinthan gulbbatidi, <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Godaw, hayyana ta na7as qadhettarkii; iya shocidi yeggiya harggey daro un77ethidi tamaninne haathan yeggees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ne tamaaretakko ehas, shin entti pathanaw dandda7ibookkona” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hinttenoo, ammanonna geella yeletethaw awude gakkanaw ta hinttera daane? Awude gakkanaw ta hinttena dandda7anee? Ane na7aa haa ekki yiite” yaagis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesuusi tuna ayyaanaa hanqettin, tuna ayyaanay na7aappe keyis; he saatenkka na7ay paxis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusa tamaareti banttarkka iyaakko shiiqidi, “Nuuni tuna ayyaanaa kessanaw dandda7iboonnay aybisse?” yaagidi oychchidosona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>I enttako, “Hinttew ammanoy laafida gishossa. Ta hinttew tuma odays; gaashe ayfe mela ammanoy hinttew de7ikko ‘Ha deriya hayssafe denddada gede aadhdha’ giikko hinttew kiitettana. Hinttew dandda7ettonabay deenna. <verse number="21" style="v"/>[Shin hessa melay woosappenne xoomappe attin haran keyenna]” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:21">Maato 21:21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:23">Mar 11:23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1Qoro 13:2</ref></char></note> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Issi issi beni maxaafatan paydo 21 deenna.</char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ba hayquwaba zaari odis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mar 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luuqa 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesuusa tamaareti Galiilan shiiqidi de7ishin Yesuusi enttako, “Asa Na7ay asa kushe aadhdhi imettana. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Entti iya wodhana, shin I heedzantho gallas hayqoppe denddana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Iya tamaaretikka daro qiirottidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Xoossa Keetha giira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesuusaranne iya tamaaretara Qifirnahoome katama gakkida wode Xoossa Keetha giira qanxiseyssati Phexiroosakko yidi, “Hintte asttamaarey Xoossa Keetha giira giirii?” yaagidi oychchidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:13">Kessa 30:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Phexiroosi zaaridi, “Giirees” yaagis. Phexiroosi soo geliya wode Yesuusi kasetidi, “Phexiroosa, new ay daanii? Ha sa7aa kawotethati qaraxanne giira ooppe ekkonaa? Gade asappeyye woykko asa gade asappe?” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Gade asappeyye woykko asa gade asappe? </char><char style="ft" closed="false">He wode kawotethati bantta gade asappe giira ekkokona.</char></note> yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Phexiroosi “Asa gade asappe” gidi zaaris.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Gade asay giira giirokkona guussu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Shin entti dhubettonna mela abbaa bada moluwa oykkiya manxxaqo yegga. Koyro ne oykkiya moluwa doona dooyada giiras gidiya miishiya ne gishonne ta gisho efada giira” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ubbaafe aadhdhey oonee?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mar 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luuqa 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>He wode Yesuusa tamaareti yidi, “Salo kawotethan ubbaafe aadhdhey oonee?” yaagidi oychchidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luuqa 22:24</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesuusi issi guutha na7a xeegidi entta giddon essidi hayssada yaagis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Taani hinttew tuma odays; hintte laamettonanne guutha naytada hanonna ixxiko salo kawotethaa ubbarakka gelanaw dandda7ekketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 10:15">Mar 10:15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:17">Luuqa 18:17</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hiza, ha guutha na7aada bana kawushshiya oonikka salo kawotethan ubbaafe aadhdheyssa gidana. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Hayssa mela na7a ta sunthan mokkiya oonikka tana mokkees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Shin tanan ammaniyaa ha guuthatappe issuwa naagara oothana mela dhube gidiya oonikka gita gaachcha woxa ba qodhen qachchidi ciimmo abban mitettiko iyaw lo77o. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Alamen asay nagara oothana mela oothiyabati de7iya gisho alamiya ayye. Hessa melabati yoonna attenna, shin dhubey iya gaason yaa uraa ayye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Ne kushey woykko ne tohoy nena balethikko neeppe qanxa yegga. Neeni nam77u kushera woykko nam77u tohora merinaa taman yeggettanayssafe kushe woykko toho duuxa gidada merinaa de7o demmeyssi new lo77o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Maato 5:30</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Qassi ne ayfey nena balethikko iyo wooca kessada wora hola. Neeni nam77u ayfera gaanname taman yeggetteyssafe issi ayfera merinaa de7uwa geleyssi new lo77o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Maato 5:29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>“Ta hinttew odays; salon de7iya entta naagiya kiitanchchoti ubba wode salon de7iya ta Aawa sinthan de7iya gisho, hintte ha guuthatappe issuwaka kadhonna mela naagettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:10-11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:10">Luuqa 19:10</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v"/>Asa Na7ay dhaydayssata ashshanaw yis” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Asa Na7ay dhayidayssata ashshanaw yis: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi beni maxaafati paydo 11 gujjoosona.</char></note> yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Dhayida dorssaa leemiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luuqa 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Qassi Yesuusi, “Hinttew ay daanii? Issi uraas xeetu dorssati de7eyssatappe issoy dhayikko uddufun tammanne uddufunata deriya bolla yeggi aggidi he dhayidayssa koyanaw beenne? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ta tuma odays; I demmida wode uddufun tammanne uddufunatappe aathidi dhayidi benttida issi dorssan ufayttees. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Hessadakka, salon de7iya hintte aaway ha guuthatappe issoy dhayana mela koyenna.</para>
  <para style="s">Qohida asi waatanee?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Ne ishay nena qohikko nerkka iyaakko bada iya balaa iyaw oda. I nena si7ikko ne ishaa new isha ootha.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:3">Luuqa 17:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="16" style="v"/>Shin I nena si7onna ixxiko, nam77u woykko heedzu asa markkan mootoy lasettiya gisho, issi woykko nam77u asi ekkada iyaakko ba.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Zaare 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>I enttana si7onna ixxiko, woosa keethas oda. Woosa keethi giyabaa si7onna ixxiko ammanonna asada woykko qaraxa qanxisiya asada iya payda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Ta hinttew tuma odays; sa7an hintte diggiyabati ubbay salon Xoossaa matan digettidaba gidana. Sa7an hintte hano giyabati ubbay salon Xoossaa matan hanidabaa gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:19">Maato 16:19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:23">Yoha 20:23</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Qassika ta hinttew odays; sa7an hinttefe nam77ay bantta woossiyabas issi wozanan gididi Xoossaa woossiyabaa gidikko salon de7iya ta Aaway hinttew oothana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tana kaalleyssatappe nam77a woykko heedza gididi shiiqiya bessan taani entta giddon benttana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Atto guussabaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>He wode Phexiroosi Yesuusakko yidi, “Godaw, ta ishay tana qohikko aappun toho taani atto gaanaw bessii? Laappun toho gakkanaaseyye?” gidi oychchis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21-22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:3-4">Luuqa 17:3-4</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Gidenna, laappun tammu toho laappunappe attin laappun toho gidenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:24">Medhe 4:24</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, Xoossaa kawotethay ba oosanchchotara ba miishey paccidaakkonne palahidaakko be7anaw qoppida kawuwa daanees. <verse number="24" style="v"/>He kawoy miishey paccidaakkonne palahidaakko be7iya wode daro ginddigindda acoy de7iya issi uraa iyaakko ehidosona. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin he aylley acuwa qanxanaw xoonettin iyara, iya machcheera, iya naytinne iyaw de7iyabay ubbay bayzettidi acoy cigettana mela iya goday kiittis. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yaatin aylley ba godaa tohuwa bolla gulbbatidi, ‘Ta godaw, hayyana guutha wode takkarkki, ta acuwa ubbaa ta ciggana’ yaagidi woossis. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Kawoy iyaw qadhettidi, yeddi aggis; iya acuwa maaris.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Shin he aylley keyi bidi ba lagge oosanchchotappe issoy baappe daro guutha miishe tal77idayssa, ‘Ne bolla de7iya ta miishiya taw cigga’ gidi qoodhe oykkis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“He iya lagge aylliya iya sinthan gulbbatidi, ‘Hayyana guutha wode takkarkki taani ta acuwa ubbaa ciggana’ yaagidi woossis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>“Shin ixxidi ekki efidi ba laggey acuwa qanxana gakkanaw qasho keethi gelssis. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hara lagge oosanchchoti hessa be7ida wode daro yilotidi, bidi bantta godaas I oothidabaa ubbaa odidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Yaatin kawoy he aylliya xeegisidi, ‘Ha iita aylliyaw, neeni tana woossida gisho, ta ne acuwa ubbaa new maaras. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yaatin, taani ne acuwa maaridayssada neeni ne lagge aylliya acuwa maaranaw new bessennee?’ yaagis. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, kawoy daro yilotidi, I ba acuwa ubbaa ciggana gakkanaw paxa kaa7ettana mela qasho keethan yeggis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>“Hessadakka, hintte issoy issoy hintte ishaa wozanappe maaronna ixxiko salon de7iya ta Aaway hinttena hessada oothana” yaagis.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Eko gelobaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Mar 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi hessa odi onggidaappe guye, Galiilappe denddidi Yorddaanose Shaafappe hefinthan de7iya Yihuda biittaa bis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Daro asay iya kaallidi bin entta giddofe hargganchchota pathis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Farisaaweti iya paaccanaw koyidi iyaakko yidi, “Issi asi ay gaasonkka ba machchiw yeddanaw bessii?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Xoossay koyro addenne maccas oothi medhdhidayssa hintte nabbabibeekketii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Medhe 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:1">5:1</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v"/>‘Hessa gisho, Issi asi ba aawanne ba aayiw aggidi ba machcheera issino gidees, nam77ayka issi asho gidoosona.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Medhe 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, entti issi asi gidoosonappe attin nam77u asi gidokkona. Hiza, Xoossi qachchidayssa asi shaakkofo” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Farisaaweti, “Yaatin, Musey issi asi anjjo worqqate immidi yeddana mela ays kiittidee?” yaagidi oychchidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:1">Medhe 24:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hinttee, hintte machcheta yeddana mela Musey hinttena kiittiday, hintte wozanaa minotethaa gishoppe attin koyroppe hessa mela gidenna. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ta hinttew odays; ba machchiya laymatonna de7ishin yeddidi hara ekkiya oonikka laammees” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Maato 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1Qoro 7:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti iyaakko, “Azinabaynne machchibay hessa mela gidikko ekko geloy attiko lo77o” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hessa mela timirttey Xoossay dandda7a immidayssatassafe attin asa ubbaassa gidenna. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hiza, yelettishe shuufa gididi yelettidayssati de7oosona, qassi asi qaaratidayssati de7oosona, qassi salo kawotethaa gisho gidi banttana shuufaydayssati de7oosona. Hessa gisho, hayssa ekkanaw dandda7iya oonikka ekko” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi guutha nayta anjjis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mar 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luuqa 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba kushiya guutha nayta bolla wothidi enttaw woossana mela issi issi asay nayta iyaakko ehidosona. Shin iya tamaareti asaa hanqettidosona. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi, “Xoossaa kawotethay hayssata melassa gidiya gisho, guutha nayti taakko yeyssa diggofite; yo giite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ba kushiya entta bolla wothidaappe guye he bessaafe aggidi bis.</para>
  <para style="s">Naatethaa dure uraa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mar 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luuqa 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Issi gallas issi uray Yesuusakko yidi, “Asttamaariyaw, taani merinaa de7o demmanaw ay lo77obaa ootho?” yaagis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusi iyaakko, “Lo77obaa ne tana ays oychchay? Issi Xoossaafe attin hari lo77oy baawa. Shin neeni merinaa de7uwa ekkanaw koykko kiitata naaga” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Uray zaaridi, “Awussa kiitata” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Wodhoppa, laymatoppa, kaysotoppa, worddo markkattofa,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-16">Kessa 20:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-20">Zaare 5:17-20</ref></char></note> <verse number="19" style="v"/>ne aawanne ne aayiw bonchcha, ne shooruwa ne huu7iyatho dosa” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Kessa 20:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Zaare 5:16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Leewe 19:18</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>He na7atethay, “Taani hayssata ubbaa na7atethafe doomada naagas. Yaatin, hari taw pacciyabay aybee?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Neeni polo gidanaw koykko bada new de7iyabaa bayzada manqotas imma; neeni salon duretana. Yaata simma yada tana kaalla” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin he naatetha uray daro dure gidiya gisho, hessa si7ida wode azzanishe aggidi bis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi ba tamaareta, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; durey salo kawotethi gelanayssi daro meto. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Dure asi Xoossaa kawotethaa gelanayssafe gimaley marppe luhora aadhdheyssi kawuyees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 4 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yesuusa tamaareti hessa si7idi malaalettidi, “Yaatin, ooni attanaw dandda7ii?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yesuusi entta caddi xeellidi, “Hayssi asas dandda7ettenna, shin Xoossas ubbay dandda7ettees” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Phexiroosi zaaridi, “Nuuni ubbabaa aggidi nena kaallida. Yaatin, nuuni ay demmanee?” yaagis. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako hayssada yaagis: “Taani hinttew tuma odays; Asa Na7ay yaana alamiyan ba bonchcho araatan uttiya wode hintte tammanne nam77ati, tana kaallidayssati, tammanne nam77u araatan uttidi tammanne nam77u Isra7eele zerethata bolla pirddana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 25:31">Maato 25:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:30">Luuqa 22:30</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ta sunthaa gisho keethe woykko ishata woykko michcheta woykko aawa woykko aayiw woykko nayta woykko gadiya aggiday oonikka xeetu kushe ekkana. Qassi merinaa de7uwakka ekkana. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Shin daroti ha77i dethan sinthe gididayssati guye gidana, qassi guye gididayssati sinthe gidana” yaagis. <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Maato 20:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luuqa 13:30</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Woyniya giddon oothiya oosanchchota leemiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“Xoossaa kawotethay ba woyniya giddon oosanchchota kera oosisanaw wontta guura keyida keethaawa daanees. <verse number="2" style="v"/>I he oosanchchotas hachchi hachchi issi dinaare <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Issi dinaare: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi asi issi gallas oothi pee7idi ekkiya miishe.</char></note> qanxanaw enttara giigidi, entta ba woyniya giddo yeddis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>“Qassi wonttafe heedzu saate gidishin keyidi ooso dhayidi giya bolla eqida hara asata demmis. <verse number="4" style="v"/>I enttako, ‘Hintteka ta woyniya giddo bidi oothite, taani hinttew bessiya gatiya qanxana’ yaagis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Enttika bidosona. Qassika I usuppun saateninne uddufun saaten keyidi hessada oothis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Tammanne issi saate gidishin I keyaa wode harati yan eqqidayssata demmidi, ‘Hintte ooso oothonna gallas kumethi hayssan ays eqqidi pee7idetii?’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Entti zaaridi, ‘Nuna kera oosisiya asi dhayida gishossa’ yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">“Ikka, ‘Hintteka ta woyniya giddo bidi oothite’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Sa7i omarssin, woyniya goday oosanchchota halaqaakko, ‘Oosanchchota xeegada wurssethan ooso gelidayssatappe doomada koyro gelidayssata gakkanaw entta gatiya qanxa’ yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:13">Leewe 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:15">Zaare 24:15</ref></char></note> <verse number="9" style="v"/>Tammanne issi saaten ooso oykkidayssati yidi, huu7en huu7en issi issi dinaare ekkidosona. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Koyro ooso oykkidayssati yidi, banttaw daro imettana gidi qoppidosona. Shin enttika huu7en huu7en issi issi dinaare ekkidosona. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Bantta miishiya ekki simmidi keethaawa bolla zuuzummidosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>‘Hayssati guyeppe yidi issi saate xalaala oothidosona. Shin gallas kumethi awa suulan daaburidi pee7ida nuura entti waanidi issino gidoona’ yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Woyniya keethaaway oosanchchotappe issuwako, ‘Ta ishaw, taani nena qohabikke; ne taara giigiday issi dinaaressa gidennee? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ne miishiya ekkada ne soo ba. Ta omarssi yidayssaskka neyssa mela immanaw koyays. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Taani ta miishiyan koyidabaa oothanaw taw maati baawe? Woykko taani keeha gidida gisho neeni qanaatay?’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Hessada ha77i dethan guye gididayssati sinthatana, sinthattidayssati qassi guyetana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:30">Maato 19:30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:31">Mar 10:31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luuqa 13:30</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ba hayquwaba heedzantho odis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mar 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luuqa 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yesuusi Yerusalaame bishe, tammanne nam77u tamaareta dumma gaxa kessidi enttako yaagis: <verse number="18" style="v"/>“Be7ite, nuuni ha77i Yerusalaame buussa bolla de7oos. Yan Asa Na7ay kahine halaqatasinne higge asttamaaretas aadhdhi imettana. Enttika iya bolla hayqo pirdda pirddana. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Iya Ayhude gidonna deriyas aathi immana. Entti iya kawushshana, garaafana, yaatidi iya masqaliya bolla kaqqana. Shin I heedzantho gallas hayqoppe denddana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Zabdiyoosa nayta aaye woosaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Mar 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>He wode Zabdiyoosa machchiya ba nam77u adde naytara Yesuusakko yada, iya sinthan gulbbatada issibaa iya woossasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesuusi iikko, “Ne ay koyay?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Iya zaarada, “Ne kawotethan ha ta nam77u nayti issoy ne ushachchan issoy ne haddirssan utto garkkii!” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi naytakko zaaridi, “Hintte ay woossiyako erekketa; taani uyanaw de7iya waaye xuu7aa uyanaw dandda7etii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Enttika, “Ee dandda7os” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi, “Tumakka taani uyanaw de7iya xuu7appe hintte uyana. Shin ta ushachchaninne haddirssan uttanayssata doorey tana gidikke. He bessay imetey, ta aaway immanaw giigisida asatassa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Attida tammu iya tamaareti hessa si7ida wode nam77u ishata bolla hanqettidosona. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi entta ubbaa xeegidi hayssada yaagis. “Ayhude gidonna asaa haareyssati bantta asaa bolla godateyssanne entta kaaletheyssati wolqqan haareyssa hintte ereeta. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Shin hintte giddon hessada gidoppo. Hinttefe gitatanaw koyaa oonikka hinttew aylle gido.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Maato 23:11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mar 9:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luuqa 22:26</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hintte giddon ubbaafe bolla gidanaw koyaa oonikka hinttew aylle gidanaw bessees. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessadakka, Asa Na7ay ase haggaazanawunne daro asaa wozanaw ba shemppuwa immanaw yisippe attin asan haggaazetanaw yibeenna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi nam77u qooqeta pathis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mar 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luuqa 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi ba tamaaretara Iyaarkkofe keyidi bishin, daro asay enttana kaallidosona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Oge gaxan uttida nam77u qooqeti Yesuusi yaara aadhdheyssa si7idi, “Godaw, Dawite Na7aw, nuus qadhettarkii” yaagidi waassidosona. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Daro asay enttana, “Hayzite” yaagidi kaccidosona. Shin entti, “Godaw, Dawite na7aw, nuus qadhettarkii” gidi gujji waassidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Yesuusi eqqidi, entta xeegidi, “Ta hinttew ay oothana mela koyeetii?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Enttika, “Godaw, nu ayfey xeellana mela koyoos” yaagidosona. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttaw qadhettidi, entta ayfiyaa bochchis. Ellesidi entta ayfey xeellis; entti iya kaallidi bidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi gita bonchchon Yerusalaame gelis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mar 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luuqa 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yoha 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusaranne iya tamaaretara Yerusalaame matidi, Shamaho Deriya bolla de7iya Beetefaage giya gutaa gakkishe, Yesuusi ba tamaaretappe nam77ata baappe sinthe yaagidi kiittis: <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Hinttefe sinthan de7iya guta biite. Yan issi harey qashon de7iyaro I maarara hintte sohuwara demmana. Entta billidi haa ekki yiite. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Oonikka hinttena oychchiko, ‘Goday enttana koyees’ yaagite. I enttana iirakka yeddi aggana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Hessika nabey,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Xiyoone katamaas,</para>
  <para style="q2">‘Hekko, ne kawoy ashkke gididi, hare bollanne</para>
  <para style="q2">hare mara bolla uttidi, neekko yees’ yaagite”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagidi xaafidayssi polettana mela hessi hanis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zakka 9:9</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti bidi Yesuusi entta kiittidayssada oothidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hariwunne hare maraa ehidi bollara ma77ida bantta ma7uwa entta zokkon yeggidosona. Yesuusi ma7ota bolla uttis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Daro asay bantta ma7uwa ogiyan hiixidosona. Harati boncco tashidi ogiya bolla yeggidosona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Yesuusappe sinthara hamutteyssatinne iyappe guyera kaalliya daro asay,</para>
  <para style="q1">“Hosaana! <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Hosaana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibraysxe doonan hosaana guussay “Nuna ashsha guussu. Qassi asay Xoossaa galatanaw go7ettiya qaala.</char></note> Dawite na7ay galatetto!</para>
  <para style="q2">Godaa sunthan yeyssi anjjettidayssa!</para>
  <para style="q1">Bonchchoy Ubbaafe Dhoqqa Saluwan Xoossaas gido!”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagidi waassidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25">Maz 118:25</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusi Yerusalaame katamaa gelida wode he kataman de7iya asay ubbay, “Hayssi oonee?” yaagidi yarkkidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Asay, “Hayssi Galiilan de7iya Naazirete katamaappe yida nabiya Yesuusa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Xoossa Keethi gelis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mar 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luuqa 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yoha 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Yesuusi Xoossa Keethi gelidi, yan bayzeyssatanne shammeyssata ubbaa kare goodis. Miishe laammeyssata xarpheezatanne holleta bayziya oydeta shiri yeggis. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ikka enttako, “Xoossaa qaalan, ‘Ta keethay Xoossaa woossiya keethi geetettana’ geetetti xaafettis. Shin hintte panggati qosettiya gonggolo oothideta” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Isa 56:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Er 7:11</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesuusi Xoossa Keethan de7ishin qooqetinne gunddati iyaakko yin entta pathis. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Shin kahine halaqatinne higge asttamaareti Yesuusi oothida malaalisiyabata be7idayssasinne guutha nayti Xoossa Keethan, “Dawite na7ay, galatetto” yaagidi waasseyssa si7idi hanqettidosona. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Entti Yesuusakko, “Hayssati geyssa ne si7ay?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi, “Ee si7ays, Xoossaa qaalan, ‘Guutha nayta doonaninne dhammiya nayta doonan galata wothadasa’ geetettidi xaafettidayssa hintte nabbabibeekketii?” yaagis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Enttana yan aggidi Bitaaniya giya katamaa bidi aqis.</para>
  <para style="s">Goday baaddida balase mithiw</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Mar 11:12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesuusi wontta guura katama simmidi yishe koshattis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Oge gaxan issi balase mithi be7idi iikko bis. Shin haythafe attin hara aykkoka demmibeenna. Hessa gisho, iyo, “Hizappe nam77antho ayfe ayfoppa!” yaagis. He balase mithiya ellesada mela aggasu.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 5 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti hessa be7idi, “Ha balasiya waanada ellesa meladee?” yaagidi malaalettidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; hinttew ammanoy de7ikko, qassi hintte sidhonna ixxiko balase bolla taani oothidayssa mela xalaala ootheketa, shin ‘Ha deriya shodettada abban wodhdha’ yaagikko hanana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Maato 17:20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1Qoro 13:2</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ammanidi hintte woossiyabaa aybibaa gidikkoka hintte ekkana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa maatay oyshettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mar 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luuqa 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi Xoossa Keetha gelidi tamaarssishin, kahine halaqatinne Ayhude cimati iyaakko yidi, “Neeni hayssa oothana mela new ay maati de7ii? New ha maata immiday oonee?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Taanikka hinttena issibaa oychchays; hintte taw hessa zaarikko, taani ay maatan oothiyako hinttew odana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Yohaannisi xammaqana mela maatay awuppe imettidee? Xoossafeyye asappe?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti bantta giddon zorettidi, “Nuuni, ‘Xoossafe’ giikko, I nuna, ‘Yaatin ays ammanibeekketii?’ yaagana. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Nuuni, ‘Asappe’ giikko, asay ubbay Yohaannisa nabe oothi xeelliya gisho, asaa yayyoos” yaagidosona. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, “Nuuni erokko” yaagidi zaaridosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Ikka, “Hiza, taanikka hayssa ay maatan oothiyako hinttew odikke” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Nam77u nayta leemiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Yesuusi kaallidikka hayssada yaagis: “Nam77u adde nayti de7iya issi uray de7ees. He uray bayra na7aakko bidi, ‘Ta na7aw, hachchi woyniya giddo bada ootha’ yaagis. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Na7ay zaaridi, ‘Atto biikke’ yaagis. Shin guyeppe ba wozanan qoppi ekkidi oothanaw bis. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Aaway ba kaalo na7aakko bidi, ba bayra na7aakko gidayssada kiittis. Ikka, ‘Ero, ta aawaw’ yaagis. Shin bibeennna. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ha nam77u naytappe ba aawas kiitettidayssi awussee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Enttika, “Bayra” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi enttako, “Ta hinttew tuma odays; qaraxa qanxiseyssatinne laymateysati hinttefe sinthattidi Xoossaa kawotethaa gelana. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Xammaqiya Yohaannisi suure ogiya tamaarssishe yin I geyssa ammanibeekketa. Shin qaraxa qanxiseyssatinne laymateysati ammanidosona. Hintte hari attoshin, entta be7idikka hintte nagaraappe simmidi ammanibeekketa” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luuqa 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:29-30">7:29-30</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Woyniya giddon oothiya goshshanchchota leemiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mar 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luuqa 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Qassika Yesuusi hayssada yaagis; “Hara leemiso si7ite, woyne tokkida issi uray de7ees. He woyniya yuushuwa diris. Woyniya gum77iya olaaka bookkis. Woyniya naaganaw shakkoka shaakkis. Hessafe guye, gadiya kothe immidi hara biitta bis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1-2">Isa 5:1-2</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v"/>Woyne ayfiyaa maxiya wodey gakkin bana gakkiya baggaa ekkidi yaana mela ba aylleta enttako yeddis. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kothe aawati iya aylleta oykkidi issuwa wadhdhidosona, hankuwa wodhidosona qassi attidayssa shuchchan caddidosona. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Woyne atakilttiya goday kaseyssatappe dariya hara aylleta kiittis. Kothe aawati entta bollaka hankkoyssata bolla oothidayssada oothidosona. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wurssethan I, ‘Ta na7aa entti bonchchana!’ yaagidi ba na7aa enttako kiittis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>“Shin kothe aawati na7aa be7idi bantta giddon ‘Gadiya laattanayssi hayssa, iya wodhidi gadiya nuuni laattoos!’ yaagidosona. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Na7aa oykkidi woyniya giddofe gaxa kissidi wodhidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Hiza, woyne atakilttiya goday yaa wode he kothe aawata waatanee?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Entti zaaridi, “I he iita asata iita wodho wodhidi, woyney ayfiyaa wode iya gakkiya baggaa woden woden immiya hara kothe aawatas immana” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi enttako, Xoossaa qaalan,</para>
  <para style="q1">“‘Gimbbeyssati boridi ixxida shuchchay,</para>
  <para style="q2">godaa xaphuwa minthiya, ubbaafe aadhdhiya shuchchaa gidis.</para>
  <para style="q1">Hayssi Goday oothidabaa;</para>
  <para style="q2">nu ayfiyaas malaalisiyabaa’</para>
  <para style="m">geetettidi xaafettidayssa nabbabibeekketii?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Maz 118:22</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, taani hinttew odays; Xoossaa kawotethay hinttefe ekettidi lo77o ayfe ayfiyaa asatas imettana. <verse number="44" style="v"/>[Ha shuchchaa bolla kunddiya ubbay meqerettana. Qassi he shuchchay iya bolla wodhdhiya uraykka gaacettana]” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi beni maxaafati paydo 44 gujjoosona (Luuqa 20:18 xeellite).</char></note> yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kahine halaqatinne Farisaaweti Yesuusi odida leemisuwan banttana odidayssa eridosona. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Entti Yesuusa oykkanaw koyidosona, shin asay Yesuusa nabe oothidi xeelliya gisho, asaas yayyidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yaagano xeessaa leemiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luuqa 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi asaas zaaridi hayssada yaagidi leemiso odis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Xoossaa kawotethay ba na7aas yaagano giigisida kawuwa daanees. <verse number="3" style="v"/>He kawoy yaagano yaana mela odi wothida asata xeeganaw ba aylleta kiittis. Shin asati yaanaw koyibookkona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Qassi hara aylleta xeegidi, xeegettida asatakko bidi, ‘Taani ta sanggatanne modhdhida gatarmenthota shukkas; ubbabay giigis. Ta yaaganuwa haa yiite yaagite’ yaagidi kiittis. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shin xeegettidayssati xeessaa ixxidi, bantta oosos oosos bidosona. Issoy ba goshshaas, hankkoy ba zal77iyas bis. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Harati qassi kawuwa aylleta oykkidi, kawushshi wadhdhidi wodhidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“Kawoy daro yilottidi, ba wotaaddareta yeddidi shemppo wodhidayssata wodhisis, entta katamakka xuuggis. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, ba aylletakko, ‘Yaaganoy giigis, shin xeegettidayssati yaaganuwas bessiya asi gidokkona. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, wogga ogeta bidi, demmida asi ubbaa yaaganuwa yaana mela xeegite’ yaagis. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Aylleti ogiya bolla bidi bantta demmida asi ubbaa lo77otanne iitata ehidi yaagano shaqara gelssidi kunthidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Shin kawoy kathaa maanaw uttida asaa be7anaw gelida wode yaagano ma7o ma77iboonna issi asi demmis. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iyaakko, ‘Laa, ne yaagano ma7o ma77onna waanada hayssa geladii?’ yaagis. Shin uray si7i gis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Kawoy ba aylletakko, ‘Ha uraa kushiyanne tohuwa qachchidi, kare dhumaa kessi yeggite. Yan iyaw yeehonne achcha garccethi gidana’ yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Maato 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:30">25:30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luuqa 13:28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Hessadakka, Xoossaa kawotethaas xeegettidayssati daro shin doorettidayssati guutha” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Giirabaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mar 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luuqa 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Farisaaweti bidi, Yesuusa waati odan oykkaneekko zorettidosona. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Bantta tamaaretanne Heroodisa baggatappe issota issota kiittidosona. Enttika, “Asttamaariyaw, ne tuma odeyssa nu eroos. Neeni asappe ase shaakkaka, asa woyganddes gada aykkoka oothaka, Xoossaa ogiya tumatethan tamaarssasa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ane nuus oda, nuuni Roome Kawuwas giira giiranaw bessi bessennee?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi entta iita qofaa eridi, “Ha cubboto, tana ays paacetii? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Giira giiriya miishiya tana bessite” yaagis. Enttika iyaw santime ehidosona. <verse number="20" style="v"/>I, “Ha sunthaynne malay oodebaye?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Entti, “Roome Kawuwayssa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">Yaatin Yesuusi enttako, “Hiza, Kawuwas besseyssa kawuwas, Xoossas besseyssa Xoossas immite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Entti hessa si7ida wode malaalettidi iya matappe aggidi bidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Hayqoppe denddobaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mar 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luuqa 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>He gallas hayqoppe denddoy baawa yaagiya Saduqaaweti Yesuusakko yidi, yaagidi iya oychchidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:8">Ha@O 23:8</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Asttamaariyaw, ‘Musey, issi asi na7a yelonna hayqqiko, he hayqqidayssa ishay iya machchiw ekkidi, ba ishaas na7a yelo’ yaagidi kiittis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Zaare 25:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nu eriya laappun ishati de7oosona. Bayray machcho ekkidi na7a yelonna hayqqis. Iya machchiw iya kaalo ishay ekkis. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hessadakka, he maccasiw ekkida nam77anthoyka, heedzanthoyka, bidi laappunati wurana gakkanaw ubbay hayqqidosona. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ubbaafe guye he maccasiya hayqqasu. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Yaatin, laappunati ubbay iyo ekkida gisho, hayqoppe denddiya gallas, he maccasiya laappunatappe awussas machcho gidanee?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hintte Xoossaa qaalay tamaarssiyabaa woykko iya wolqqaa eronna gisho baleeta. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Asay hayqoppe denddiya wode salon de7iya kiitanchchota mela gidanaappe attin ekkokona gelokkona. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Qassi hayqqida asati hayqoppe denddanabaa Xoossay hinttew odidayssa nabbabibeekketii? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Xoossay, ‘Taani Abrahaame Xoossaa, Yisaaqa Xoossaa, Yayqooba Xoossaa’ yaagis. Hessa gisho, Xoossay paxa de7eyssata Xoossaafe attin hayqqidayssata Xoossaa gidenna” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Xoossay paxa de7eyssata Xoossaafe attin hayqqidayssata Xoossaa gidenna: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesuusi ha bessan odey Xoossay ha hayqqida heedzatas Xoosse gidikko entti de7on de7oosona yaageyssa.</char></note> yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kessa 3:6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Daro asay hessa si7idi, iya timirttiyan malaalettidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Ubbaafe bayratiya kiitaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Mar 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luuqa 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesuusi Saduqaawetas gaanabaa dhayssidayssa Farisaaweti si7ida wode issife shiiqidosona. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Entta giddofe issi higge asttamaarey Yesuusa paace oysho oychchis. <verse number="36" style="v"/>“Asttamaariyaw, higge ubbaafe aadhdheyssi awussee?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “‘Ne Godaa, ne Xoossaa, ne kumetha wozanappe, ne kumetha shemppuwafe, ne kumetha qofaappe dosa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Zaare 6:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ubbaafe aadhdheyssinne bayra kiitay hayssa. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nam77antho ubbaafe aadhdhiya kiitay, ase ubbaa ne huu7iya ne doseyssada dosa’ yaageyssa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Leewe 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="40" style="v"/>Muse higgeynne nabeta timirttey ubbay ha kiitata bolla katoosona” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:35-40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luuqa 10:25-28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosabaa oychchida oysha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mar 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luuqa 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Farisaaweti issi bolla shiiqidi de7ishin, Yesuusi enttana, <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Kiristtoosabaa hintte woygetii? I oode na7ee?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti, “I Kawuwa Dawite na7a” yaagidi zaaridosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Yaatin, Dawitey Geeshsha Ayyaanan gididi waattidi Kiristtoosa, ‘Godaa’ gidi xeegii? Dawitey gishe,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>‘Godaa Xoossay, ta Godaakko,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ta Godaakko: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dawitey ta Godaa geyssi Kiristtoosa bessees.</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz 110:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q2">ne morkketa ne tohoy yedhdhiyaso oothana gakkanaw,</para>
  <para style="q2">hayssan taappe ushachcha baggan <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Ushachcha baggan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maatanne bonchcho bessi.</char></note> utta’ gis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz 110:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hiza, Dawitey Kiristtoosa Godaa gidi xeegikko, waanidi Kiristtoosi Dawite na7a gidii?”</para>
  <para style="m">yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Yesuusas issi qaala zaaranaw dandda7ida asi oonikka baawa. Qassi he gallasappe doomidi hara oysha oychchanaw oonikka dandda7ibeenna.</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Higge asttamaaretanne Farisaaweta iitatethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Mar 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luuqa 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yesuusi shiiqida asaasinne ba tamaaretas hayssada yaagis. <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Higge asttamaaretinne Farisaaweti Muse higgiya billanaw maatara de7oosona. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, entti hinttena kiittiya ubbaa oothitenne naagite. Shin entti ootheyssada oothofite. Ays giikko, entti oodeyssada oothokona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Entti tookkanaw dandda7ettona tooho qachchidi asaa toossoosona. Shin banttaw hari attoshin, he toohuwa asay tookkiya wode biradhdhe xeeran bochchanaw koyokkona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>“Shin entti bantta ooso ubbaa asi be7onna mela oothoosona. Bantta som77oninne qesen qachchiya maxaafaa xiqisey de7iya kitaafe dalggisosona, bantta ma7uwa macaraakka adussoosona.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Som77oninne qesen qachchiya maxaafaa… ma7uwa maccara adussoosona: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hessa entti oothey Xoossaas ta imettas giya malla bessanaassa (Zaare 15:37-41).</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:1">Maato 6:1</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:8">Zaare 6:8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 15:38">Tay 15:38</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mokettiya bessan bonchcho bessinne Ayhude Woosa Keethatan daro lo77iya oyde dosoosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Asay giyan enttana bonchchon sarothanayssanne ‘Asttamaariyaw’ gidi xeeganayssa koyoosona.</para>
  <para style="rem">fig 6 fig*</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>“Shin hintte asttamaarey issuwa xalaala gidida gishonne hintte ubbay ishata gidida gisho, ‘Asttamaariyaw’ geetettidi xeegettofite. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hinttew salon issi aawa xalaali de7iya gisho, ha sa7an oonakka ‘Aawaw’ gidi xeegoppite. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Hinttew issi Goday Kiristtoosa xalaali de7iya gisho ‘Godaw’ geetetti xeegettofite. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hintte giddon bayratey hintte aylle gido.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Maato 20:26</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Bana gitayiya oonikka kawuyana; bana kawushshiya oonikka gitatana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luuqa 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Higge asttamaaretinne Farisaaweti borettidosona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Mar 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luuqa 11:39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Hinttenoo, cubboto, higge asttamaaretonne Farisaaweto, asa sinthan salo kawotethaa gorddeyssato hinttena ayye. Hinttee, hintte huu7en gelekketa qassi haratakka gelssekketa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>[“Hinttenoo cubboto, higge asttamaaretonne, Farisaaweto, am77eta keetha hintte bonqishe, asi be7o gidi woosa adusseeta. Hessa gisho, hinttena ayye. Ubbaafe aadhdhiya pirdday hinttena naagees.] <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Issi issi beni maxaafati paydo 14 gujjoosona.</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Hinttenoo, cubboto, higge asttamaaretonne Farisaaweto, hintte issi uraa ammanthanaw abbaranne sa7ara yuuyeta. Shin hintte iya ammanthida wode he uraa hinttefe aathidi Gaannames giigettidayssa oothiya gisho, hinttena ayye.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>“Oonikka Xoossa Keethan caaqqiko aykkoyka baawa. Shin Xoossaa Keethan de7iya worqqan caaqqiko, he caaqoy iya gomana giya qooqeto, hinttew qooqidi harata kaaletheyssato, hinttena ayye. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hinttenoo, eeyato, qooqeto, worqqay aadhdhiyye? Worqqiya Xoossaas dummayiya Xoossa Keethay aadhdhii? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Qassi ‘Oonikka yarshsho yarshshiya bessan caaqqiko, aykkoyka baawa. Shin oonikka iya bolla de7iya yarshshuwan caaqqiko, he caaqoy iya gomana’ yaagidi tamaarsseta. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hinttenoo, qooqeto, yarshshoy aadhdhiyye? Yarshshuwa Xoossaas dummayiya bessay aadhdhii? <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, yarshsho bessan caaqqiya uray, he yarshsho bessaaninne iya bolla de7iya ubbaban caaqqees. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Xoossa Keethan caaqqiya uray, he Xoossa Keethaninne iyan de7iya Xoossan caaqqees. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Salon caaqqiya uray Xoossaa araataninne he araata bolla uttiya Xoossan caaqqees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:1">Isa 66:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:34">Maato 5:34</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“Hinttenoo, cubboto, higge asttamaaretonne Farisaaweto, hinttena ayye. Hintte kareetha sawoppe, naatiroppenne okasheppe asraata kesseta. Shin higgiyan de7iya aadhdhi koshsheyssata aggideta. Hessika xillo pirdda, qadhetethinne ubbaban ammanetethi. Haratakka aggonnashin hayssata hintte oothanaw bessees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 27:30">Leewe 27:30</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>Hinttew qooqidi hara asi kaaletheyssato, hintte ushshaafe udunxe kessidi gimale mitteeta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>“Hinttenoo, cubboto, higge asttamaaretonne Farisaaweto, hinttena ayye. Hintte shaatiyasinne keriyas bolla baggaa geeshsheeta. Shin enttaw garssan bonqeynne uuzetethi kumi uttis. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Neno qooqe Farisaawiyaw, shaatiyasinne keriyas garssaa kasetada geeshsha. Hessafe guye, bolla baggayka geeshshi gidana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>“Hinttenoo, cubboto, higge asttamaaretonne Farisaaweto, hinttena ayye. Kare baggara qalame tiyettidi lo77idi, giddon meqethinne wooqidabay kumida duufota daaneta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:3">Ha@O 23:3</ref></char></note> <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessadakka, bolla baggara asas lo77o daaneta. Shin hintte garssan cubbotethinne iitatethi kumis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“Hintteno, cubboto, higge asttamaaretonne Farisaaweto, hinttena ayye. Hintte nabetas duufo keexeta, qassi xillota duufuwakka loytheeta. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Qassi hintte, ‘Nuuni beni nu aawata wode de7idabaa gidiyakko, enttara issife nabeta suuthaa guussokoshin’ yaageeta. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, hintte nabeta wodhida asaa nayta gideyssa hinttee hintte huu7en markkatteeta. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte aawati doomidayssa hintte polite.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>“Ha shooshatoo, shoosha nayto, hintte Gaanname pirddaafe waanidi attanee?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:7">Maato 3:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:34">12:34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luuqa 3:7</ref></char></note> <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, ta odeyssa si7ite; taani nabeta, cincca asatanne asttamaareta hintteko kiittana. Enttafe issota issota hintte wodhananne masqaliya bolla kaqqana. Baggata Ayhude Woosa Keethatan lisson garaafananne katamaappe katama gooddana. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, xilluwaa Aabela wodhida wodiyappe doomidi, Xoossa Keethasinne yarshsho bessaafe giddon hintte wodhida Baraakiya na7aa Zakkariyaasa wode gakkanaw hayqqida xillo asa ubbaa gisho, hintte seerettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Medhe 4:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:20">2Taari 24:20</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v"/>Taani hinttew tuma odays; hinttenne hintte aawati oothida balaas ha pirdda ubbay ha yeletethaa bolla gakkana.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Yerusalaames yeekkis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luuqa 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Yerusalaame, Yerusalaame, nabeta wodhiyare! Xoossay neekko kiittidayssata shuchchan caddiyare! Kuttoy ba nayta ba qefen haphpheyssada taani ne asaa ta qesiyan gechchanaw aappun toho koyadina! Shin tana diggadasa. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte Xoossaa keethay kaysi gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:5">Er 22:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="39" style="v"/>Taani hinttew odays; ‘Godaa sunthan yeyssi anjjettidayssa’ hintte gaana gakkanaw nam77antho tana be7ekketa” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Maz 118:26</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Xoossa Keethay laalettanayssa kasetidi odis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mar 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luuqa 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi Xoossa Keethafe keyidi bishin, iya tamaareti iyaakko yidi, malaalettidi Xoossa Keetha gimbbiya bessidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako zaaridi, “Ee! Hayssa ubbaa be7etii? Taani hinttew tumaa odays; shuchchi shuchcha bolla gimbbettida mela laalettonna attenna” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Sinthafe hananabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Mar 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luuqa 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Yesuusi Shamaho Deriya bolla uttidashin, iya tamaareti banttarkka iyaakko yidi, “Hessi awude hananeekko nuus oda. Qassi ne yuussasinne wodiya wurssethaas malaatay aybee?” yaagidi oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Hinttena oonikka balethonna mela naagettite! <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ays giikko, daro asati ta sunthan, ‘Taani Kiristtoosa, Xoossay asaa ashshanaw kiittidayssa’ yaagishe yidi daro asaa balethana. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Matan de7iya ola girssaa, haahon de7iya ola wore si7anaw de7eeta. Hessa melabay hananaw bessiya gisho hirggofite. Shin wurssethay buroona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Derey deriyara, issi kawotethay hara kawotethaara olettana. Koshaynne biittaa qaaxoy ubba bessan hanana. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessi ubbay yelo iqethas zooke mela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“He wode asay hinttena waayes aathi immana, qachchananne wodhana. Ta sunthaa gisho asa ubbay hinttena ixxana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Maato 10:22</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>He wode daroti ammano aggana. Bantta giddon issoy issuwa aathidi immana, issoy issuwa ixxana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Qassi daro worddo nabeti denddidi darota balethana. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Makkallatethi dariya gisho, daro asaa siiqoy irxxana. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Shin wurssethi gakkanaw gencciya uray attana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Maato 10:22</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v"/>Asa ubbaas markka gidana mela Xoossaa kawotethaa Wonggelay biitta ubban odettana. Hessafe guye, wurssethay yaana.</para>
  <para style="s">Tuna bashshaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Mar 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luuqa 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, nabiya Daaneli odida bashshaa tunatethay geeshsha bessan eqqidayssa hintte be7ana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:27">Zaare 9:27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 11:31">11:31</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:11">12:11</ref></char></note> (Akeekiso: Hessi woy guusseeko nabbabeyssi akeeko!) <verse number="16" style="v"/>He wode Yihuda biittan de7eyssati deriyakko baqato. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Keetha huu7en de7iya uray ba son de7iyabaa ekkanaw soo gelonna baqato.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luuqa 17:31</ref></char></note> <verse number="18" style="v"/>Gaden de7eyssi ba ma7uwa ekkanaw guye simmofo. <verse number="19" style="v"/>He wode qantha maccasatasinne dhanthiya maccasatas daro un77a gidana. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Balggon woykko Sambbaatan hintte baqatoy gidonna mela Xoossaa woossite. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ays giikko, sa7i medhettosappe hachchi gakkanaw hanonnabay, qassi sinthafekka ubbarakka hanonna waayey he wode hanana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:1">Medhe 12:1</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Yo@Qo 7:14</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v"/>Xoossay he gallasata taybuwa guuthonnaako ase gidida oonikka attenna. Shin I ba doorida asata gisho, he gallasata taybuwa guuthana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>“He wode oonikka hinttena, ‘Hekko, Kiristtoosi hayssan’ woykko ‘Hinin de7ees’ yaagikko ammanoppite. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ays giikko, worddo Kiristtoosatinne worddo nabeti denddana. Enttaw dandda7ettiko, hari attoshin Xoossay dooridayssatakka balethanaw gita malaatatanne malaalisiyabata oothana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Akeekite, taani hinttew hayssa kasetada odas.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Hessa gisho, asay hintteko, ‘Hekko, Kiristtoosi bazzon de7ees’ giikko, yaa booppite. Woykko hintteko, ‘Hekko, qol77an de7ees’ giikko, enttabaa ammanoppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:26-27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:23-24">Luuqa 17:23-24</ref></char></note> <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ays giikko, wol77anthi salon wol77ammidi, dolohappe wuloha gakkanaw bentteyssada, Asa Na7aa yuussay hessada hanana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>“Bawuti de7iyson ankoti shiiqana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:37">Luuqa 17:37</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosi nam77antho yaana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Mar 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luuqa 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>“He wode he waaye gallasatappe guye,</para>
  <para style="q1">sohuwara away dhumana,</para>
  <para style="q2">ageenay ba poo7uwa diggana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Isa 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:10">Er 2:10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">Xoolinttoti saloppe wodhdhana,</para>
  <para style="q2">qassi salon de7iya wolqqati buqettana.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>He wode Asa Na7aa yuussaa mallay saluwa bolla benttana. Sa7an de7iya asi ubbay yeekkana. Qassi Asa Na7ay, wolqqaranne gita bonchchuwara saluwa shaara giddora yishin entti be7ana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:13">Zaare 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:10">Zakka 12:10</ref></char></note> <verse number="31" style="v"/>I ba kiitanchchota gita punniya moyzera kiittana. Entti sa7aa oyddu baggaa bidi, ha gaxappe ya gaxa gakkanaw de7iya iyaw doorettidayssata shiishana.</para>
  <para style="s">Goday yaana gallasaa mallata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Mar 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luuqa 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>“Balase giya mitheefe tamaarite. Iya aacada hayxiya wode torchchey matattidayssa hintte ereeta. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Hessadakka, hintte ha ubbabaa be7iya wode Yesuusi matidi penggen de7eyssa erite. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Taani hinttew tuma odays; ha ubbabay polettana gakkanaw, ha yeletethay aadhdhenna. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Saloynne sa7ay aadhdhana, shin ta qaalay ubbaka aadhdhenna.</para>
  <para style="s">Goday yaana gallasaa oonikka erenna</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Mar 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luuqa 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>“He gallasaanne he saatiya salon de7iya ta aawappe attin hari salo kiitanchchota gidin woykko Na7aa gidin oonikka erenna. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Asa Na7aa yuussay, Nohe wode hanidayssa mela gidana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6:5">Medhe 6:5</ref></char></note> <verse number="38" style="v"/>He wode bashsha haathay yaanappe sinthe Nohey markkabiyan gelida gallasa gakkanaw, asay mishenne uyishe, ekkishenne gelishe gam77is. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Bashsha haathay yidi, entta ubbaa dhayssana gakkanaw akeekibookkona. Asa Na7aa yuussayka hessada hanana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>“He wode nam77u asati gaden oothana. Enttafe issoy ekettana, hankkoy attana. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Nam77u maccasati issife gaaccana. Enttafe issiniya ekettana hankkiya attana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Hiza, hintte Goday ay gallas yaanekko hintte eronna gisho, minnidi naagite. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Shin kaysoy qammafe ay saaten yaanekko keethaaway eriyakko, ba keethay bookettonna mela barkkidi naaganashin.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:43-44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:39-40">Luuqa 12:39-40</ref></char></note> <verse number="44" style="v"/>Hessadakka, Asa Na7ay hintte qopponna saaten yaana gisho, hintteka giigidi de7ite.</para>
  <para style="s">Iitanne lo77o aylleta leemiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luuqa 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>“Yaatin, ba soo asaas kathaa koshshiya wodiyan immana mela, iya goday doorida ammantheysinne wozanaama aylley oonee? <verse number="46" style="v"/>I ba goday kiittidayssa oothishin iya goday yidi demmiya aylley anjjettidayssa. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Taani hinttew tuma odays; goday he aylliya babaa ubbaa bolla shuumana. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Shin he aylley iita gidikko, ‘Ta goday gam77idi yaana’ yaagidi ba wozanan qoppidi, <verse number="49" style="v"/>ba lagge oosanchchota wadho doomikko, mathotteyssatara miikkonne uyikko, <verse number="50" style="v"/>he aylliya goday I qopponna gallasinne I eronna saaten, <verse number="51" style="v"/>yidi iya qanxerethana. Iya qaadaa cubbotara oothana. He bessan iyaw yeehonne achche garccethi gidana.</para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Tammu geela7ota leemiso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>“He wode salo kawotethay bantta kuraaziya oykkidi, machcho ehanaw bida addiya mokkanaw keyida tammu geela7ota daanees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:35">Luuqa 12:35</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Enttafe ichchashati eeya, qassi ichchashati cincca. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Eeyati kuraaze oykkidosona, shin hara lambba oykkibookkona. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Shin cinccati bantta kuraaziyanne hara guzha lambba oykkidosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Machchiw ekkeyssi gam77in, he geela7oti banttana dhiskkoy oykkin dhiskkidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>“Giddi bilahe gidiya wode, ‘Hekko, machchiw eheyssi gakkis, iya mokkanaw keyite’ yaagiya gita cabboy si7ettis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>“He wode he geela7oti ubbay barkkidi, bantta kuraaziya giigisidosona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Eeyati cinccatakko, ‘Nu kuraazey to7ana haniya gisho, hintte lambbaafe nuus immerkketi’ yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>“Shin cinccati enttako zaaridi, ‘Akkay, nuusinne hinttes gidiya lambbi baawa. Hessa gisho, hinttew bidi shammidi ekkite’ yaagidosona. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Eeya geela7oti lambba shammanaw bin, machchiw ekkeyssi puttu gis. Giigeti uttida ichchashu geela7oti iyara issife yaagano keethaa gelidosona; kareykka gorddetti aggis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>“Guyeppe hankko geela7oti yidi, ‘Godaw, godaw, nuus dooyarkii’ yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>“Shin I enttako zaaridi, ‘Taani hinttew tuma odays; ta hinttena erikke!’</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>“Hiza, Asa Na7ay yaana gallasaa woykko saatiya hintte eronna gisho barkkidi naagite.</para>
  <para style="s">Heedzu oosanchchota leemiso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luuqa 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>“Xoossaa kawotethay ba oosanchchota xeegidi baw de7iyabaa enttaw sheedhdhidi oge baanaw keyida uraa daanees.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:14-30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luuqa 19:11-27</ref></char></note> <verse number="15" style="v"/>Enttaw huu7en huu7en entta wolqqaa mela issuwas ichchashu karxiite bira, issuwas nam77u karxiite bira qassi issuwas issi karxiite bira immidi ba ogiya bis. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ichchashu karxiite bira ekkida aylley sohuwara bidi zal77idi, hara ichchashu karxiite bira wodhisis. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessadakka, qassi nam77u karxiite bira ekkida aylley hara nam77u karxiite bira wodhisis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Shin issi karxiite bira ekkidayssi bidi, olla bookkidi, ba godaa miishiya moogis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>“Daro wodeppe guye he aylleta goday yidi, ba miishiya enttara salla77is. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ichchashu karxiite bira ekkida aylley yidi, hara ichchashu karxiite bira ehidi, ‘Ta godaw, neeni taw ichchashu karxiite bira immadasa. Shin taani hara ichchashu karxiite bira wodhisas’ yaagis. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iya goday, ‘Zambboy! Neeni lo77onne ammanthiya aylle; neeni guuthaban ammanettadasa. Taani nena darobaa bolla shuumana; haa gelada ne godaara ufaytta’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>“Qassi nam77u karxiite bira ekkidayssi yidi, ‘Ta godaw, neeni taw nam77u karxiite bira immadasa. Shin taani hara nam77u karxiite bira wodhisas’ yaagis. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Iya goday, ‘Zambboy! Neeni lo77onne ammanthiya aylle; neeni guuthaban ammanettadasa. Taani nena darobaa bolla shuumana; haa gelada ne godaara ufaytta’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>“Qassi issi karxiite bira ekkidayssi yidi, ‘Ta godaw, neeni zeronna bessafe cakkeyssanne dharcconna bessafe maxiya iita asi gideyssa taani erays. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, yayyada ne biraa biittan moogas. Ne miishey hayssish’ yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>“Iya goday zaaridi, ‘Ha iita azalla aylliyaw, taani zeronna bessafe cakkeyssanne dharcconna bessafe maxiya asi gideyssa eradasa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Yaatin, neeni ta miishiya bankken wothidabaa gidiyakko, taani simmiya wode ta miishiya wodhera ekkanayssa diggadasa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, miishiya iyappe ekkidi, tammu karxiite biri de7eyssas immite. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ays giikko, de7iya ubbaas guzhettananne darana. Shin baynnayssafe hari attoshin, he iyaw de7iya guuthiyaka ekettana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Maato 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:25">Mar 4:25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:18">Luuqa 8:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ha maaddonna aylliya kare dhumaa kessi yeggite. Yan iyaw yeehonne achche garccethi gidana’ yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:12">Maato 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 22:13">22:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:28">Luuqa 13:28</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s">Wodiya wurssethan hanana pirddaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>“Asa Na7ay, kiitanchcho ubbatara, ba bonchchuwara yaa wode I ba bonchcho kawota araata bolla uttana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:27">Maato 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:28">Maato 19:28</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v"/>Biittan de7iya asi ubbay iya sinthe shiiqana. Henthanchchoy dorssata deeshatappe shaakkeyssada I he asaa nam77an shaakkana. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Qassi dorssata ushachcha baggara deeshata haddirssa baggara essana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>“Hessafe guye, kawoy ushachcha baggara de7eyssatakko hayssada yaagana: ‘Ta Aaway anjjidayssato, haa yidi sa7ay medhettiya wode hinttew giigida kawotethaa laattite. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ays giikko, taani koshattin muzideta, saamottin ushshideta, erettona imatha asi gidada bin mokkideta, <verse number="36" style="v"/>kallottin mayzideta, harggettin harggisideta, qashettin tana oychchideta’ yaagana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>“Hessafe guye, xilloti zaaridi, ‘Godaw, neeni koshattin awude be7idi muzidoo? Woykko neeni saamottin awude be7idi ushshidoo? <verse number="38" style="v"/>Neeni imathe gidada yin awude be7idi mokkidoo? Woykko neeni kallottin awude mayzidoo? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Neeni harggin woykko qashettin neekko bidi nena awude oychchidoo?’ yaagana. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kawoy zaaridi, ‘Taani hinttew tuma odays; hintte tana kaalliya ha ubbaafe guuxeyssas oothidayssa taw oothideta’ yaagana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>“He wode haddirssa baggara de7eyssatakko, ‘Ha qanggettidayssato, ta matappe haakkite. Xalahesinne iya kiitanchchotas giigida merinaa taman biite. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ays giikko, koshattin tana muzibeekketa; saamottin ushshibeekketa. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Taani imathe gidada bin tana mokkibeekketa, kallottin mayzibeekketa, harggininne qashettin tana oychchibeekketa’ yaagana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>“He wode entti, ‘Godaw, neeni koshattin woykko saamottin woykko imathe gidada bin woykko kallottin woykko harggin woykko qashettin be7idi nena awude maaddonna ixxido?’ yaagidi zaarana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>“He wode kawoy zaaridi enttako, ‘Taani hinttew tuma odays; hintte tana kaalliya ha ubbaafe guuxeyssa maaddonna ixxidayssi, tana maaddonna ixxidayssa’ yaagana. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, he asati merinaa pirddas qassi xilloti merinaa de7uwas baana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:2">Daane 12:2</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa bolla maqettidosona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mar 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luuqa 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yoha 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Yesuusi ha timirttiya ubbaa wurssida wode ba tamaaretakko, <verse number="2" style="v"/>“Nam77u gallasappe guye, Faasika Baale bonchchiya gallas gideyssa ereeta. He gallas Asa Na7ay masqaliya bolla kaqettanaw asa kushen aadhdhi imettana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1">Kessa 12:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>He wode kahine halaqatinne cimati, Qayyaafa giya kahine halaqaa keethan shiiqidi, <verse number="4" style="v"/>asi eronna Yesuusa oykkidi, wodhanaw maqettidosona. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Shin entti, “Asay ooshshi kessonna mela gidi, Faasika bonchchiya gallas hessa oothoko” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Issi maccasiya Yesuusa shitto tiyasu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Mar 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yoha 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Yesuusi Bitaaniya kataman baro harggida Simoona son de7ees. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Yesuusi imatuwa bolla de7ishin issi maccasiya albasxiroose philqqaaxe kumetha daro al77o shitto ekka yada Yesuusa huu7en tigasu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luuqa 7:37</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusa tamaareti hessa be7idi hanqettidi, “Ha shittoy coo iitey aybisse? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ha shittoy al77o gaten bayzettidi, miishey manqotas imettanaw dandda7ettees” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Yesuusi entti geyssa eridi, enttako, “Ha maccasiw ays waaysetii? Iya taw lo77obaa oothasu. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Manqoti ubba wode hinttera daana. Shin taani hinttera ubba wode de7ikke.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Zaare 15:11</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iya ha shittuwa ta bolla tigidayssi tana mooganaw giigisanaassa. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Taani hinttew tuma odays; biitta ubban ha Wonggelay sabbakettiya bessan awunkka, asay iyo hassayana mela iya oothidayssi odettana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yihudi Yesuusa aathidi immanaw giigettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Mar 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luuqa 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>He wode tammanne nam77u Yesuusa tamaaretappe issoy Asqoroota Yihuda geetetteyssi kahine halaqatakko, <verse number="15" style="v"/>bidi, “Taani hinttew Yesuusa aatha immiko, hintte taw ay immanee?” yaagidi entta oychchis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12">Zakka 11:12</ref></char></note> Entti zorettidi hasttamu bira santime <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bira santime: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aykkoyka guzhettiboonna geeshsha bira guussu.</char></note> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hasttamu bira santime: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hasttamu bira santimey Isra7eele biittan aylley shamettiyanne bayzettiya gate.</char></note> immidosona. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Yihudi Yesuusa aathidi immanaw injjetiya wode wochchees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Faasika kahuwa ba hawaaretara mis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Mar 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luuqa 22:7-14</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yoha 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Uytha Baale bonchchiya koyro gallas, Yesuusa tamaareti iyaakko yidi, “Faasika bonchchiya gallas neeni maana kathi nuuni awun giigisino?” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako, “Kataman de7iya addiyako bidi, ‘Asttamaarey, taw wodey gakkida gisho, ta tamaaretara Faasika bonchchiya gallasa ne son aathana yaagees’ yaagite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Iya tamaareti Yesuusi banttana kiittidayssada oothidi, Faasika Baale gallas maana kathaa giigisidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Sa7ay omarssiya wode, Yesuusi tammanne nam77u hawaaretara kathi maanaw uttis. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Entti miishin, Yesuusi enttako, “Taani hinttew tuma odays; hinttefe issi uray tana aathidi immana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Entti daro dagammidi, huu7en huu7en, “Godaw, tuma taneshsha?” gidi iya oychchidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ba kushiya taara issife shaatiyan yeddeyssi I tana aathidi immana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Maz 41:9</ref></char></note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>Asa Na7ay, Xoossaa qaalan iyaw xaafettidayssada hayqqana. Shin Asa Na7aa aathidi immiya uraa ayye; he uray yelettonna attidaakko iyaw lo77oshin” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Iya aathi immanaw de7iya Yihudi zaaridi, “Asttamaariyaw, neeni gey taneyye?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Neeni ne huu7en gadasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Godaa kahuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Mar 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:15-20">Luuqa 22:15-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Qoro 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Entti mishin, Yesuusi uythaa ekkidi Xoossaa galatis. He uythaa menthidi ba tamaaretas immidi, “He7ite, miite, hayssi ta ashuwa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Xuu7aa ekkidi, Xoossaa galatis. Enttaw immidi, “Ubbay hayssafe uyite. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Hayssi daro asaa nagaray atto geetettana mela gukkiya ta suuthaa. Ha suuthay Xoossay hinttera geliya caaquwa mintheyssa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kessa 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31">Er 31:31</ref></char></note> <verse number="29" style="v"/>Shin taani hinttew odays; taani ta Aawa kawotethan ooratha woyne ushshaa hinttera uyana gallasa gakkanaw nam77antho ha woyne ushshaa uyikke” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Galata mazmure yexxidayssafe guye, Shamaho Deriya bidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Phexiroosi kaddanayssa koyrottidi odis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mar 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luuqa 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yoha 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>He wode Yesuusi enttako,</para>
  <para style="q1">“‘Xoossay henthanchchuwa shocana</para>
  <para style="q2">dorssatikka laalettana’</para>
  <para style="m">geetettidi Xoossa qaalan xaafettidayssa mela hachchi qamma hintte ubbay tana aggidi baqatana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zakka 13:7</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v"/>Shin taani hayqoppe denddidaappe guye hinttefe sinthatada Galiila baana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Maato 28:16</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Phexiroosi zaaridi, “Entti ubbay nena aggidi baqatikkoka, taani nena aggike” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Yesuusi Phexiroosakko, “Taani new tuma odays; hachchi qamma kuttoy waassanaappe sinthe neeni tana heedzu toho kaddana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Phexiroosi zaaridi, “Taani neera issife hayqoppe attin nena ubbaka kaddike” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Hankko iya tamaareti ubbayka hessada gidoosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Geetesemaanen woossis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mar 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luuqa 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yaatidi, Yesuusi ba tamaaretara Geetesemaane giya bessaa bidi, enttako, “Taani hini bada Xoossaa woossashshana, hintte hayssan uttite” yaagis. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Phexiroosanne Zabdiyoosa nayta nam77ata baara ekki bidi daro azzanonne un77etethi doomis. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Qassika enttako, “Taani hayqos gathiya un77a un77ettas. Hayssan taara gam77itenne minnidi naagite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Guuthi sinthe bidi biittan gufannidi, “Ta Aawaw, dandda7ettiyaba gidikko ha waaye xuu7aa taappe digga. Shin ne sheney hanoppe attin ta sheney hanoppo” yaagidi Xoossaa woossis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Yesuusi ba tamaaretakko simmi yidi entti dhiskkidashin demmis. Phexiroosakko, “Hintte issi saatekkonne dhiskkonna taara minnanaw dandda7ibeekketii? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Paacen hintte gelonna mela barkkidi naagitenne Xoossaa woossite. Hinttew lo77o amoy de7ees, shin hintte daaburanchcho asi” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Yesuusi qassi nam77antho bidi, “Ta Aawaw, taani ha waaye xuu7appe uyonna de7ishe aadhdhanaw dandda7ettonnabaa gidikko ne sheney hano” yaagidi Xoossaa woossis. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Qassika simmi yaa wode iya tamaareta ayfiyaa dhiskkoy goozin, zin77idashin demmis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Qassika entta aggi bidi, kase qaalaa zaari heedzantho woossis. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, ba tamaaretakko yidi, “Ha77i gakkanaw dhiskkeetinne shemppetii? Hekko, Asa Na7ay, nagaranchchota kushen aadhdhi imettiya saatey gakkis. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Denddidi yedhdhite, tana aathidi immeyssi hayssish gakkis” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ba morkketan oykettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mar 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luuqa 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yoha 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Yesuusi buroo hessa haasayishin, tammanne nam77u tamaaretappe issoy, Yihudi gakki wodhdhis. Kahine halaqatinne deriya cimati kiitida daro asati mashshenne xam77a oykkidi iyara issife yidosona. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Yesuusa aathi immiya Yihudi he daro asaakko, “Taani yeereyssi hintte koyeyssi iya, iya oykkite” yaagidi malla immi wothis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Iirakka Yesuusakko shiiqidi, “Asttamaariyaw, saro de7ay” yaagidi iya yeeris.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesuusi iyakko, “Ta laggiyaw, neeni oothanabaa ootha agga” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta laggiyaw, neeni oothanabaa ootha agga: woykko hara birshshethay ta laggiyaw, ne hayssan ay oothay?</char></note> yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Hessafe guye, shiiqidi, Yesuusa oykkidosona. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Yesuusara de7eyssatappe issoy ba mashsha shoddidi kahine halaqaa aylliya shocidi, iya haythaa qanxidi yeggis. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi, “Ne bisuwa guye shoohuwan zaara. Ays giikko, mashsha shoddiya ubbay mashshan hayqqana. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Ta, ta Aawa woossiyako daro mukulun taybettiya kiitanchchota yeddanaw dandda7onnabaa new daanii? <verse number="54" style="v"/>Yaatin, Xoossaa qaalan hessada hananaw bessees geetettidayssi waanidi polettanee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>He saatiyan, Yesuusi he shiiqida daro asaakko, “Tana pangga oothidi oykkanaw mashshanne xam77a oykkidi yidetii? Taani Xoossa Keethan gallas gallas tamaarssashe hinttera de7iya wode tana oykkibeekketa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luuqa 19:47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21:37</ref></char></note> <verse number="56" style="v"/>Shin hayssi ubbay hanidayssi nabeti Xoossaa qaalan xaafidayssi polettana melassa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">He wode iya tamaareti ubbay iya aggidi baqatidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi pirdda Shanggo sinthe shiiqis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Mar 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luuqa 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yoha 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Yesuusa oykkidayssati kahine halaqaa Qayyafakko iya efidosona. Yan higge asttamaaretinne biitta cimati shiiqidi de7oosona. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Shin Phexiroosi kahine halaqaa zabbaa gakkanaw haahon iya kaallis. Iya wurssethay shaakettana gakkanaw zabbaa gelidi naageyssatara uttis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Kahine halaqatinne shiiqida asay ubbay Yesuusa wodhanaw iya bolla worddo markka koyidosona. <verse number="60" style="v"/>Daroti yidi iya bolla worddo markka markkattidosona shin aykkoka demmibookkona. Guyeppe nam77u asati yidi, <verse number="61" style="v"/>“Ha uray, ‘Taani Xoossa Keetha laallada heedzu gallasan zaara keexanaw dandda7ays’ yaagis” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Yoha 2:19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Kahineta halaqay denddi eqqidi Yesuusakko, “Hayssati nena mootiya mootowas neeni zaariyabay baawe?” yaagis. <verse number="63" style="v"/>Shin Yesuusi si7i gis. Qassika kahine halaqay, “Taani nena de7o Xoossaa sunthan oykkays; neeni Xoossaa Na7aa Kiristtoosa gidikko nuus oda” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v"/>Yesuusi zaaridi, “Neeni ne huu7enkka gadasa. Shin taani hinttew odays; hizappe guye, hintte Asa Na7ay wolqqaama Xoossaa ushachcha baggan uttidashin, qassi salo shaarara yishin hintte be7ana” yaagis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Daane 7:13</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>He wode kahine halaqay daro yilotidi ba ma7uwa peedhidi, “Hayssa be7ite Xoossaa cayis! Nuna hara markka ay koshshii? I ha77i cayidayssa hintte si7ideta.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:65-66 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:15-16">Leewe 24:15-16</ref></char></note> <verse number="66" style="v"/>Hintte qofay aybee?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Enttika, “Iyaw hayqo bessees” yaagidi zaaridosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Yaatin, entti iya som77uwan cuttidi dechchidosona. Harati iya baqqidi,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26:67 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 50:6">Isa 50:6</ref></char></note> <verse number="68" style="v"/>“Kiristtoosaa! Nena dechchiday oonee? Ane nuus oda” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Phexiroosi Yesuusa kaddis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mar 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luuqa 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yoha 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>Phexiroosi zabban uttidashin, issi aylliya iyaakko yada, “Neenikka Galiila Yesuusara issife de7aasa” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Shin I entta ubbaa sinthan he aylleko, “Neeni giyabay aybeekko taani erikke” yaagidi kaddis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Qassi bidi dirssaa penggeko gakkishin hara aylliya iya be7ada, yan de7iya asaakko, “Ha uray Naazirete Yesuusara de7ees” yaagasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Phexiroosi nam77antho caaqqidi, “Taani he uraa erikke!” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v"/>Guutha gam77ishin, yan eqqida asati Phexiroosakko yidi, “Nekka tuma enttara issife de7aasa; neeni ne haasayan erettasa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Phexiroosi, “Taani he uraa erikke!” yaagidi, bana qanggethinne caaqo doomis.</para>
  <para style="p">He wode iirakka kuttoy waassi aggis. <verse number="75" style="v"/>Yesuusi iyakko, “Neeni kuttoy waassanaappe sinthe tana heedzu toho kaddana” gidayssa Phexiroosi akeekidi, kare keyidi iita yeeho yeekkis.</para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yihudi bana sullis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Mar 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-3">Luuqa 23:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yoha 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Wontta guura kahine halaqatinne biitta cimati ubbay Yesuusa wodhisanaw maqettidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Entti Yesuusa qachchi efidi deriya haariya Philaaxoosas aathidi immidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>He wode Yesuusa oythida Yihudi, Philaaxoosi Yesuusa bolla pirddidayssa be7idi, qiirottidi, he hasttamu biraa santimiya kahine halaqatasinne deriya cimatas guye zaaris.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:3-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Ha@O 1:18-19</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v"/>“Taani xillo asi hayqos aatha immada nagara oothas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">Shin entti, “Hessi nu meto gidenna ne meto” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Yihudi miishiya Xoossaa Keethan yeggi aggidi entta matappe bidi, sulleti hayqqis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kahine halaqati miishiya ekkidi, “Ha miishey suutha miishe gidiya gisho, nuuni Xoossa Keethaa miishiyara gatheyssi woga gidenna” yaagidosona. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, issife zorettidi, bete asi mooganaw mana biitta shammidosona. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, he gadey hachchi gakkanaw suutha biitta geetetti xeegettees.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nabiya Ermmiyasi, “Isra7eele asay iyaw qanxanaw gammattida hasttamu bira santime ekkidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:9-10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Zakka 11:12-13</ref></char></note> <verse number="10" style="v"/>Goday tana kiittidayssada mana biitta shammanaw immidosona” gidayssi he wode polettis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi Philaaxoosa sinthan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Mar 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luuqa 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yoha 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Yesuusi deriya haariya Philaaxoosa sinthe shiiqin, Philaaxoosi iyaakko, “Neeni Ayhude kawo?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Yesuusi zaaridi, “Ne gadasa” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kahine halaqatinne biitta cimati iya mootiya wode enttaw aybi zaarokka immibeenna.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>He wode Philaaxoosi Yesuusakko, “Hayssati nena mootiya mootuwa ubbaa si7ikkii?” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yesuusi hari attoshin, issi qaalakka zaaronna ixxin, deriya haareyssi daro malaalettis.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa bolla hayqo pirddettis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Mar 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luuqa 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-40">Yoha 18:39-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19:1-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Deriya haareyssi laythan laythan Faasika Baale bonchchiya gallasan, asay koyaa issi asi qashoppe birshshiya wogi de7ees. <verse number="16" style="v"/>He wode issi Barbbaana Yesuusa giya daro erettida iita asi qasho keethan de7ees. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, daro asay shiiqidi de7ishin Philaaxoosi, “Taani hinttew Barbbaana Yesuusa birshshoyye, woykko Yesuusa giya Kiristtoosa birshsho?” yaagidi asaa oychchis. <verse number="18" style="v"/>I hessa giday entti qanaattidi Yesuusa oythidayssa eriya gishossa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi pirdda keethan uttidashin, iya machchiya, “Taani hachchi qamma amuhon iyabaa daro waayettashe aqida gisho, he xillo uraa bolla aybibaakka oothofa” yaagada kiittasu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Shin kahine halaqatinne deriya cimati Philaaxoosi Barbbaana birshshidi, Yesuusa wodhana mela, asay iya woossana mela, asaa cimmidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi zaaridi enttako, “Taani entta nam77aafe hinttew oona billana mela koyeetii?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Entti, “Barbbaana billana mela koyoos” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi, “Yaatin, Yesuusa giya Kiristtoosa waato?” yaagidi entta oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Ubbay zaaridi, “Masqaliya bolla iya kaqqa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi asaakko, “Ays? I ay iitabaa oothidee?” yaagidi oychchis.</para>
  <para style="p">Shin asay kaseyssafe aathidi, “Masqaliya bolla iya kaqa” gidi waassidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ooshshi denthethofe hara aybibaakka oothanaw dandda7ettonayssa Philaaxoosi be7idi, haathe ekkidi, “Ha uraa hayquwan taani de7ikke. Hessa oothey hinttena” yaagidi asaa sinthan ba kushiya meecettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 21:6">Zaare 21:6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Asa ubbay zaaridi, “Iya suuthaa gomey nunanne nu nayta gakko” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yaatin, Philaaxoosi Barbbaana enttaw billidi, Yesuusa lisson garaafidi, masqaliya bolla kaqettidi hayqqana mela enttaw aathidi immis.</para>
  <para style="s">Wotaaddareti Yesuusa qelqisidosona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Mar 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yoha 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, Philaaxoosa wotaaddareti Yesuusa deriya haareyssa soo ekki efin, wotaaddareti ubbay iya yuushuwan eqqidosona. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Iya afilaa qaari ekkidi zo7o afila <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">zo7o afila: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Beni wode kawoti bollara ma77iya afila.</char></note> mayzidosona. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Qassi aguntha kalachcha giigisidi, iya huu7en wothidosona. Iya ushachcha kushiyan mayre xam77a oythidi, iya sinthan gulbbatidi, “Ayhude kawaw, mukulu laythi kawota!” yaagidi, iya bolla qelqisidosona. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Iya bolla cuttidosona. He mayre xam77aa ekkidi, iya huu7en shocidosona. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Entti iya bolla qelqisidayssafe guye, zo7o afilaa iyappe qaari ekkidi, iya afilaa iya mayzidosona. Masqaliya bolla iya kaqqanaw ekki efidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa kaqetethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mar 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:25-43">Luuqa 23:25-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yoha 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Entti kare keyidi, issi Simoona giya Qerena biitta asi demmidi, Yesuusa masqaliya wolqqan toossidosona. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Golggotta giya bessi gakkidosona. “Golggotta” guussay “Guugge bessi” guussu. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Hessan entti ciye walakettida woyne ushshaa uyo gidi iyaw immidosona. Shin I hessa ganxi ekkidi, uyonna ixxis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz 69:21</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Entti masqaliya bolla iya kaqqidayssafe guye, iya afilaa shaakkidi, saama yeggidi ekkidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:18">Maz 22:18</ref></char></note> <verse number="36" style="v"/>Hessafe guye, yan uttidi iya naagidosona. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Qassi, “Hayssi Ayhude Kawuwa Yesuusa” yaagiya mooto xuufiya iya huu7e son wothidosona. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Yesuusara he wode nam77u panggata issuwa iyappe ushachcha baggan, hankkuwa iyappe haddirssa baggara, masqaliya bolla kaqqidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ogiyara aadhdhiya asay Yesuusa boridi, iya bolla cuttishe,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:7">Maz 22:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:25">109:25</ref></char></note> <verse number="40" style="v"/>“Xoossa Keethaa laallada heedzu gallasa giddon keexeysso, nena ashsha. Neeni Xoossaa Na7a gidikko, ane masqaliya bollafe wodhdha” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:61">Maato 26:61</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Yoha 2:19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Hessadakka, kahine halaqati, higge asttamaaretinne biitta cimati issife Yesuusa bolla qelqisidosona. Hayssada yaagidosona: <verse number="42" style="v"/>“Harata ashshis, shin bana ashshanaw dandda7ibeenna. I Isra7eele kawo gidikko, ane masqaliya bollafe ha77i wodho, nukka iya ammanana. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Xoossan I ammanettees, Xoossay iya ashshanaw koykko ane ashsho. Ays giikko, I bana, ‘Taani Xoossaa Na7a’ gees” yaagidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:8">Maz 22:8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Qassi hari attoshin, iyara masqaliya bolla kaqettida panggatika hessada gidi iya bolla qelqisidosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa hayquwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mar 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luuqa 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yoha 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Usuppun saateppe bidi, uddufun saate gakkanaw biitta ubbay dhumis. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Uddufun saate gidiya wode Yesuusi, “Elohee, Elohee, lama sabaqitani?” gidi gita waaso waassis. “Elohee, Elohee, lama sabaqitani?” geyssa birshshethay “Ta Xoossaw, ta Xoossaw, tana ays aggadi?” guussu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Maz 22:1</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Hessan eqqida asaappe issoti issoti hessa si7idi, “Ha uray Eliyaasa xeegees” yaagidosona. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Iira enttafe issoy woxxi bidi, ispponjje ekkidi, caala woyne ushshaa kunthis. Hessa mayre xam77a xeeran wothidi ushshanaw iya doonakko shiishis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:21">Maz 69:21</ref></char></note> <verse number="49" style="v"/>Shin hankkoti, “Naaga, Eliyaasi iya ashshanaw yaanekko ane be7oos” yaagidosona. <verse number="50" style="v"/>Yesuusi nam77antho gita waaso waassidi, hayqqi aggis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>He saaten Xoossa Keethan kaqettida magaraajjoy qommofe duge gakkanaw nam77u keyidi, peedheti wodhdhis. Biittay qaaxxis, zaallayka phalqqettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31">Kessa 26:31</ref></char></note> <verse number="52" style="v"/>Duufoti dooyettin Xoossaa asatappe daroti hayqoppe denddidosona. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Entti duufoppe keyidi, Yesuusi hayqoppe denddidayssafe guye, geeshsha katamaa bidosona; yan entti daro asaas benttidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Mato halaqaynne iyara Yesuusa naagiya wotaaddareti biittay qaaxxidayssanne hessan hanidabaa be7ida wode daro yayyidi “Tuma hayssi Xoossaa Na7aa” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>Hessan daro maccasati, Galiilappe doomidi Yesuusa haggaazishe kaallidayssati haahon eqqidi xeellosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:55-56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 8:2-3">Luuqa 8:2-3</ref></char></note> <verse number="56" style="v"/>Entta giddon Magdela Mayraama, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:56 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Magdela Mayraamo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Guussay Magdela giya katamaappe yida Mayraamo guusu.</char></note> Yayqoobanne Yoosefa aayiya Mayraamanne Zabdiyoosa machchiya de7oosona.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa moogetethaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mar 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luuqa 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yoha 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Sa7ay omarssiya wode Yoosefa giya issi dure uray, Armmatiyasa katamaappe yis. I ba huu7enkka Yesuusa kaalliya asi. <verse number="58" style="v"/>Yoosefi Philaaxoosakko bidi, Yesuusa ahaa ekkanaw woossis. Philaaxoosi ahay Yoosefas imettana mela kiittis. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Yesuusa ahaa ekkidi, geeshsha moogo afilan xaaxis. <verse number="60" style="v"/>Baw moogettanaw shuchchafe woocida ooratha gonggolon iya ahaa wothis. Qassi he gonggoluwa doonan gita shuchchaa gonddorssi wothidi aggi bis. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Magdela Mayraamanne hankko Mayraama he gonggoluwakko simmidi uttidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Wontethe Sambbaata gallas, kahine halaqatinne Farisaaweti Philaaxoosakko yidi, hayssada yaagidosona: <verse number="63" style="v"/>“Godaw, ha worddanchchoy paxa de7ishe, ‘Taani heedzu gallasappe guye, hayqoppe denddana’ yaagidayssi nuus hassayettis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:21">Maato 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:23">17:23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 20:19">20:19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:31">Mar 8:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:31">9:31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:33">10:33</ref></char></note> <verse number="64" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, I moogettida gonggoluwa heedzu gallas gakkanaw, minthi naagana mela kiittarkki. Hessi dhayikko iya tamaareti bidi, iya ahaa kaysi dhayssidi, ‘Hayqoppe denddis’ yaagidi asaas odikko nam77antho balesoy koyroyssafe ubba haa iitana” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v"/>Philaaxoosi enttako, “Hinttew naageyssati de7oosona; bidi hinttew dandda7ettida mela naagisite” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Hessa gisho, entti bidi duufoy boshettonna mela shuchchaa bolla maatame wothidi wotaaddaretan naagisidosona.</para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Yesuusa hayqoppe dendduwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Mar 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luuqa 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yoha 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Sambbaatay aadhdhin Wogga wode wontta guura, Magdela Mayraamanne hankko Mayraama Yesuusi moogettida gonggoluwa be7anaw bidosona. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Qopponna wolqqaama biitta qaaxoy hanis. Godaa kiitanchchoy saloppe wodhdhidi duufuwa doonan de7iya shuchchaa gonddorssidi iya bolla uttis. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Iya malay wol77anthi daanees. Iya ma7oykka shachchada boothi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Naageyssati kiitanchchuwa be7idi, yashshan kokkoridi, hayqqida asada hanidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kiitanchchoy maccasatakko, “Hintte masqaliya bolla kaqettida Yesuusa koyeyssa taani eriya gisho, yayyofite. <verse number="6" style="v"/>I kase odidayssa mela hayqoppe denddis; hayssan deenna. Haa yidi iya zin77isida bessaa be7ite. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hintte ha77i ellessi bidi, iya tamaaretas, ‘Yesuusi hayqoppe denddis. Qassi I hinttefe sinthattidi Galiila baana; hintte iya yan be7ana’ yaagidi odite. Taani hinttew hayssa odanaw yas” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Entti yayyishenne daro ufayttishe, duufuwa matappe ellessidi bidi, iya tamaaretas odanaw woxxidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Qopponna Yesuusi enttara gayttidi enttako, “Saroy hinttew gido” yaagis. Entti iyaakko shiiqidi, iya tohuwa oykkidi iyaw goynnidosona. <verse number="10" style="v"/>He wode Yesuusi enttako, “Yayyofite; bidi ta tamaareti Galiila baana mela enttaw odite. Entti yan tana be7ana” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>He maccasati bishin, duufuwa naagiya wotaaddaretappe baggati katamaa bidi, hanidabaa ubbaa kahine halaqatas odidosona. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kahine halaqatinne cimati shiiqidi zorettidi, wotaaddaretas daro miishe immidi, <verse number="13" style="v"/>“‘Nuuni dhiskkidashin iya tamaareti qamma yidi, iya ahaa kaysidosona’ yaagite. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ha odaa deriya haareyssi si7ikko, hessi hintte bala gidonnayssa nuuni iya odi ammanthana. Hinttena aybikka hirggisoppo” yaagidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wotaaddareti miishiya ekkidi, kiitettidayssada oothidosona. Ha oday Ayhude matan hachchi gakkanaw odettishe de7ees.</para>
  <para style="s">Yesuusi ba tamaaretas qonccis</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mar 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luuqa 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yoha 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Ha@O 1:6-8</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:3-8">1Qoro 15:3-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Tammanne issi iya tamaareti Yesuusi banttana biite gida Galiilaa Deriya bolla bidosona.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Maato 26:32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mar 14:28</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v"/>Yan entti iya be7ida wode iyaw goynnidosona, shin enttafe issoti issoti sidhidosona.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Yesuusi enttako shiiqidi, “Saloninne sa7an maati ubbay taw imettis. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hiza, hintte ubba bessi bidi, Aawa, Na7aa, Geeshsha Ayyaana sunthan ase ubbaa xammaqidi tana kaalleyssata oothite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Ha@O 1:8</ref></char></note> <verse number="20" style="v"/>Taani hinttena kiittidaba ubbaa entti naagana mela entta tamaarssite. Taani wodiya wurssethaa gakkanaw ubba wode hinttera de7ays” yaagis.</para>
  <para style="restore">02-Oct-2008@09:05, Backup Description=23-Sep-2008@16:55, Ed Owen -</para>
</usx>
